rulings: ["[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “blocking creature” is one that has been declared as a blocker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield blocking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be a blocking creature through the end of combat step, even if the creature or creatures it was blocking are no longer on the battlefield or have otherwise left combat.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "A creature dealt combat damage by Queen of Ice won\'t untap during its controller\'s next untap step, even if it was already tapped and even if Queen of Ice leaves the battlefield before then (perhaps because that creature dealt lethal combat damage to Queen of Ice)."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Rage of Winter can target a creature that\'s already tapped. That creature won\'t untap during its controller\'s next untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "A creature entering the battlefield or dying at the same time as Hushbringer (including Hushbringer itself entering or dying) won\'t cause abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Abilities that apply “as [this creature] enters the battlefield,” such as choosing a color with Diamond Knight, are unaffected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers on a card leaving a zone (such as that of Syr Konrad, the Grim) won\'t trigger if that card is leaving its previous zone because it\'s entering the battlefield as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers on an event that causes a creature to die will still trigger. For example, an ability that triggers “whenever you sacrifice a creature” still triggers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a card is put into a graveyard “from anywhere” may still trigger even if a creature dies. It will trigger if the ability is of a dying creature that triggers only when that creature is put into a graveyard from anywhere, if Hushbringer is the card being put into a graveyard, or if Hushbringer leaves the battlefield at the same time as the dying creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers when a creature “leaves the battlefield” won\'t trigger if that creature leaves the battlefield by dying."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Hushbringer affects a creature\'s own triggered abilities as well as other triggered abilities that trigger when that creature enters the battlefield or dies. Such triggered abilities start with “when” or “whenever.”"}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Look at each permanent as it exists on the battlefield, taking into account continuous effects that apply to it after entering or before dying, to determine whether any triggered abilities will be stopped from triggering. For example, if a land that has become a creature dies, an ability that triggers when it dies doesn\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Replacement effects are unaffected by Hushbringer\'s ability. For example, a creature that enters the battlefield with one +1/+1 counter on it will still receive a +1/+1 counter, and Leyline of the Void will still exile creatures that would die."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The trigger event doesn\'t have to specifically refer to “creatures.” In these cases, the trigger event may also refer to something being “put into a graveyard from the battlefield.” For example, an ability that triggers “whenever an artifact is put into a graveyard from the battlefield” won\'t trigger if an artifact creature dies while Hushbringer is on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "A legendary permanent that is put into a graveyard because of the “legend rule” isn\'t sacrificed."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice Korvold, its last ability triggers. You won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything, but you\'ll draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice a permanent as part of a spell or activated ability\'s cost, Korvold\'s last ability will resolve before that spell or ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you somehow control no other permanents, you can attack with Korvold. You won\'t sacrifice anything, and there\'s no penalty for being unable to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Korvold\'s last ability is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn\'t allow you to sacrifice a permanent whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of sacrificing permanents, such as Korvold\'s first triggered ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "A permanent that\'s both an artifact and an enchantment is counted only once."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because All That Glitters is an enchantment, the enchanted creature usually gets at least +1/+1.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You still control Auras that you put onto the battlefield attached to a permanent you don\'t control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "A permanent that\'s both an artifact and an enchantment is only counted once."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "As long as Shambling Suit is on the battlefield, its ability will count itself, so it\'ll be at least 1/3."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Shambling Suit\'s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "A permanent that\'s both an artifact and an enchantment satisfies both of Shinechaser\'s abilities, so Shinechaser gets +2/+2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "A spell that can\'t be countered is a legal target for Didn\'t Say Please. The spell won\'t be countered when Didn\'t Say Please resolves, but its controller still puts the top three cards of their library into their graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "A spell that can\'t be countered is a legal target for Mesmeric Glare. The spell won\'t be countered when Mesmeric Glare resolves, but you\'ll still exile Mesmeric Glare."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "A spell that\'s both an artifact and an enchantment spell causes Alela\'s last ability to trigger only once."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Alela\'s last ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Acclaimed Contender\'s ability can get you at most one card from the top five cards, no matter how many other Knights you control."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Acclaimed Contender\'s ability won\'t trigger if you don\'t control another Knight immediately after it enters the battlefield. If you don\'t control another Knight as that ability resolves, the ability has no effect. This doesn\'t have the be the same Knight at both times, however."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Activated abilities contain a colon. They\'re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Triggered abilities (starting with “when,” “whenever,” or “at”) are unaffected by Trapped in the Tower."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the enchanted creature gains flying, Trapped in the Tower is put into your graveyard as a state-based action. The creature won\'t get stuck in the tower again when it loses flying."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Activating Gingerbrute\'s middle ability after it has become blocked by a creature without haste won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Gingerbrute to activate the last ability of Tempting Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Activating Lochmere Serpent\'s first activated ability after it has become blocked won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An Island is a land with the subtype Island, not any land that could produce blue mana. For example, Mystic Sanctuary is an Island, but Castle Vantress isn\'t. Similarly, a Swamp is a land with the subtype Swamp, not any land that could produce black mana."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If each target card is an illegal target by the time Lochmere Serpent\'s last ability resolves, the entire ability won\'t resolve. Lochmere Serpent won\'t be returned."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If up to four of the target cards are illegal targets by the time Lochmere Serpent\'s last ability resolves, the remaining legal targets are exiled and Lochmere Serpent is returned to your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate Lochmere Serpent\'s last ability without targeting five cards in a single opponent\'s graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Adamant effects check what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn\'t otherwise spend, but it doesn\'t change what mana you spent to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Because state-based actions don\'t destroy a creature with lethal damage marked on it until a player would receive priority, gaining indestructible from Outmuscle will save your creature if it\'s dealt lethal damage in the fight."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can\'t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can\'t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery spell has an adamant ability, you perform the spell\'s instructions in order. You don\'t perform the adamant instruction before the spell resolves or before any other effects printed above it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If either target is an illegal target as Outmuscle tries to resolve, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the creature you control is an illegal target as Outmuscle tries to resolve, no creature gets a +1/+1 counter. If that creature is a legal target but the creature you don\'t control isn\'t, it still gets a +1/+1 counter and gains indestructible if appropriate."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you copy a spell that has an adamant ability, no mana was spent to cast the copy at all, so that ability won\'t apply."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Outmuscle unless you choose both a creature you control and a creature you don\'t control as targets."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Adamant effects check what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn\'t otherwise spend, but it doesn\'t change what mana you spent to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can\'t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can\'t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery spell has an adamant ability, you perform the spell\'s instructions in order. You don\'t perform the adamant instruction before the spell resolves or before any other effects printed above it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If at least three black mana was spent to cast Foreboding Fruit, you\'ll create a Food, even if you have another player draw two cards and lose 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you copy a spell that has an adamant ability, no mana was spent to cast the copy at all, so that ability won\'t apply."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Some spells that instruct you to create a Food token have targets. You can\'t cast these spells without choosing all required targets, and if all of those targets become illegal targets, the spell won\'t resolve and you won\'t create any Food. If some but not all of those targets become illegal, you\'ll do as much as possible, including creating Food."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Adamant effects check what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn\'t otherwise spend, but it doesn\'t change what mana you spent to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can\'t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can\'t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery spell has an adamant ability, you perform the spell\'s instructions in order. You don\'t perform the adamant instruction before the spell resolves or before any other effects printed above it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target nonland permanent is an illegal target by the time Turn into a Pumpkin tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t draw a card, and you won\'t create a Food if you spent three blue mana to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you copy a spell that has an adamant ability, no mana was spent to cast the copy at all, so that ability won\'t apply."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Some spells that instruct you to create a Food token have targets. You can\'t cast these spells without choosing all required targets, and if all of those targets become illegal targets, the spell won\'t resolve and you won\'t create any Food. If some but not all of those targets become illegal, you\'ll do as much as possible, including creating Food."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Adamant effects check what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn\'t otherwise spend, but it doesn\'t change what mana you spent to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can\'t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can\'t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery spell has an adamant ability, you perform the spell\'s instructions in order. You don\'t perform the adamant instruction before the spell resolves or before any other effects printed above it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If one of the two target cards is an illegal target by the time Once and Future resolves, you\'ll put the other in the appropriate zone and exile Once and Future. If both targets are illegal, the spell won\'t resolve and you won\'t exile Once and Future."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you copy a spell that has an adamant ability, no mana was spent to cast the copy at all, so that ability won\'t apply."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You choose which card will be returned to your hand and which will be put on top of your library as you choose those cards as targets, not as Once and Future resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Adamant effects check what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn\'t otherwise spend, but it doesn\'t change what mana you spent to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can\'t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can\'t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery spell has an adamant ability, you perform the spell\'s instructions in order. You don\'t perform the adamant instruction before the spell resolves or before any other effects printed above it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Searing Barrage tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. No player will be dealt damage, even if you spent three red mana."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you copy a spell that has an adamant ability, no mana was spent to cast the copy at all, so that ability won\'t apply."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Searing Barrage\'s adamant ability causes it to deal additional damage. It doesn\'t replace the damage dealt to the target creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Adamant effects check what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn\'t otherwise spend, but it doesn\'t change what mana you spent to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can\'t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can\'t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery spell has an adamant ability, you perform the spell\'s instructions in order. You don\'t perform the adamant instruction before the spell resolves or before any other effects printed above it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you copy a spell that has an adamant ability, no mana was spent to cast the copy at all, so that ability won\'t apply."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You create Humans and gain life all while Rally for the Throne is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Adamant effects check what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn\'t otherwise spend, but it doesn\'t change what mana you spent to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can\'t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can\'t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery spell has an adamant ability, you perform the spell\'s instructions in order. You don\'t perform the adamant instruction before the spell resolves or before any other effects printed above it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you copy a spell that has an adamant ability, no mana was spent to cast the copy at all, so that ability won\'t apply."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Adamant effects check what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn\'t otherwise spend, but it doesn\'t change what mana you spent to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can\'t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can\'t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery spell has an adamant ability, you perform the spell\'s instructions in order. You don\'t perform the adamant instruction before the spell resolves or before any other effects printed above it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If the creature would enter the battlefield with no +1/+1 counters on it, it enters with one +1/+1 counter on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you copy a spell that has an adamant ability, no mana was spent to cast the copy at all, so that ability won\'t apply."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'No player may take actions between the time you put cards into your graveyard, the time you choose a creature card to return, and the time you return that card to the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The creature card you return with Cauldron\'s Gift may be one that you just put into your graveyard with its adamant ability. This is because Cauldron\'s Gift doesn\'t target the card that you\'ll return."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Adamant effects check what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn\'t otherwise spend, but it doesn\'t change what mana you spent to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can\'t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can\'t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you copy a spell that has an adamant ability, no mana was spent to cast the copy at all, so that ability won\'t apply."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked this creature, changing the power of the blocking creature won\'t cause this creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Adamant effects check what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn\'t otherwise spend, but it doesn\'t change what mana you spent to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can\'t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can\'t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you copy a spell that has an adamant ability, no mana was spent to cast the copy at all, so that ability won\'t apply."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Adventurer cards aren\'t instant or sorcery cards while they\'re in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If The Magic Mirror leaves the battlefield while its last ability is on the stack, the ability will use the number of knowledge counters The Magic Mirror had before leaving the battlefield to determine how many cards you\'ll draw."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a split card is both an instant card and a sorcery card, it\'s only counted once for The Magic Mirror\'s cost reduction ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting a spell, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change by how much a relic\'s cost is reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The cost reduction ability reduces only the generic mana in the relic\'s cost. The colored mana must still be paid."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Although the common lands have basic land types, they aren\'t basic lands."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once the common lands (such as Mystic Sanctuary) enter the battlefield tapped, there\'s no way to untap them with a spell or ability to make their last ability trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The mana generated by Castle Garenbrig\'s last ability can\'t be spent to activate abilities of creature cards that aren\'t on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Although the common lands have basic land types, they aren\'t basic lands."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once the common lands (such as Mystic Sanctuary) enter the battlefield tapped, there\'s no way to untap them with a spell or ability to make their last ability trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An Equipment that\'s also a creature can\'t be attached to anything. You can activate its equip ability, but it won\'t become attached. If it\'s attached as it becomes a creature, it becomes unattached."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An artifact that becomes a creature due to Bring to Life can\'t attack unless you\'ve controlled it continuously since your turn began."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Bring to Life\'s effect lasts indefinitely. It doesn\'t wear off during the cleanup step."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If another effect later causes the artifact to become a creature and sets its power and toughness as it does so, that creature will have that base power and toughness; it won\'t be 0/0. Notably, crewing a Vehicle does not set its power and toughness, so a Vehicle\'s base power and toughness remain 0/0 if you crew it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An Equipment that\'s also a creature can\'t be attached to anything. You can activate its equip ability, but it won\'t become attached."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'An artifact creature or enchantment creature returned this way will be a 4/4 creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If X is 6 or more, the artifacts and/or enchantments enter the battlefield as 4/4 creatures. They don\'t enter as noncreature permanents and then become creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, that X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If another effect causes one of the returned permanents to become a creature and sets its power and toughness as it does so, that creature will have that power and toughness; it won\'t be 4/4. Notably, crewing a Vehicle does not set its power and toughness, so a Vehicle will remain a 4/4 creature if you crew it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Bonecrusher Giant\'s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a spell targets Bonecrusher Giant more than once, its ability triggers only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the chosen target is an illegal target by the time Stomp tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. Damage can be prevented as usual."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Protection prevents damage, so protection will be unable to prevent damage after Stomp has resolved. However, this won\'t allow a spell or ability to target illegally, even if that spell or ability would cause damage to be dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Stomp only stops damage from being prevented by effects that specifically use the word “prevent.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Flaxen Intruder\'s triggered ability goes on the stack without a target. While that ability is resolving, you may sacrifice it. When you do, the reflexive triggered ability triggers and you pick a target artifact or enchantment to be destroyed. This is different from effects that say “If you do . . .” in that players may take actions after you\'ve sacrificed Flaxen Intruder but before the artifact or enchantment is destroyed."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Lovestruck Beast\'s power and toughness are reduced to 1/1, it learns that loving oneself is the first step on the true path to happiness, and it can attack even if you control no other 1/1 creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once Lovestruck Beast is attacking, it\'ll remain attacking even if you no longer control a 1/1 creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to attack with a 1/1 creature for Lovestruck Beast to be able to attack. You just need to control a 1/1 creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target creature or planeswalker is an illegal target by the time Swift End tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t lose 2 life or exile Swift End. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you do lose 2 life and exile Swift End."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "On Alert can target a creature that\'s already untapped. It will still get +2/+2."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Beanstalk Giant\'s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You choose which card, if any, to discard while Haggle is resolving. In contrast, you must discard a card to activate the ability of Merchant of the Vale.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Curry Favor causes the opposing team to lose X life twice, after you gain X life once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'In a casual game, a card you choose from outside the game comes from your personal collection. In a tournament event, a card you choose from outside the game must come from your sideboard. You may look at your sideboard any time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'The activated ability of Fae of Wishes can be activated only while Fae of Wishes is on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If two targets are chosen for Dizzying Swoop and one of them becomes an illegal target but not the other, the legal target will be tapped and Dizzying Swoop will be exiled. If both targets are illegal, Dizzying Swoop will be put into your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If Reaper of Night attacks a planeswalker, the controller of the planeswalker is the defending player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the defending player has three or more cards in hand as Reaper of Night attacks, its ability won\'t trigger at all. If that player has three or more cards in hand as the ability resolves, it doesn\'t gain flying."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once Reaper of Night\'s ability has resolved, the number of cards in defending player\'s hand no longer matters. Reaper of Night won\'t gain or lose flying if that number changes later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An artifact that becomes a creature due to Workshop Elders can\'t attack unless you\'ve controlled it continuously since your turn began."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If another effect later causes the artifact to become a creature and sets its power and toughness as it does so, that creature will have that base power and toughness; it won\'t be 0/0. Notably, crewing a Vehicle does not set its power and toughness, so a Vehicle\'s base power and toughness remain 0/0 if you crew it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The effect of Workshop Elders\'s triggered ability lasts indefinitely. It doesn\'t wear off during the cleanup step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Edgewall Innkeeper\'s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a creature card, creature spell, or creature that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Garenbrig Squire\'s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a creature card, creature spell, or creature that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a creature card, creature spell, or creature that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Wandermare\'s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a creature card, creature spell, or creature that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Memory Theft allows you to put any face-up exiled card with an Adventure that player owns into their graveyard, not just one that was cast as an Adventure and exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You choose which exiled adventurer card, if any, to put into that player\'s graveyard after seeing their hand. You may do this even if that player has no nonland cards in hand, or even no cards at all."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An effect that instructs you to “cast” a card doesn\'t allow you to play lands."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If Robber of the Rich leaves the battlefield, the effect allowing you to cast the exiled card if you attacked with a Rogue continues to apply, even during later turns—as long as you attack with a Rogue during those later turns.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, the controller of the planeswalker is the defending player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the defending player doesn\'t have more cards in hand than you immediately after Robber of the Rich attacks, its ability doesn\'t trigger at all. If that player doesn\'t have more cards in hand as the ability resolves, the ability does nothing. It doesn\'t matter if that player has fewer or the same number of cards in hand in between these two times, or if they have fewer or the same number of cards in hand later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an Adventure with Robber of the Rich, it\'s you, not the card\'s owner, who may cast the creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spells and/or permanents you control from Robber of the Rich\'s effect are exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Robber of the Rich\'s effect doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'The card Robber of the Rich exiles is exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can cast the exiled card if the Rogue that attacked is still in combat, if it\'s left combat, if it\'s left the battlefield, or even if combat is over."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Any effects that modify Bramblefort Fink\'s power and/or toughness without setting them to a specific number or value will apply after its base power and toughness are set, regardless of the order in which those effects were created. The same is true of counters that modify its power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whether you control an Oko planeswalker is checked only as you begin to activate Bramblefort Fink\'s ability. It doesn\'t matter if Oko leaves the battlefield before the ability resolves or later in the turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Any effects that modify a creature\'s power and/or toughness without setting them to a specific number or value will apply after its base power and toughness are set, regardless of the order in which those effects were created. The same is true of counters that modify its power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Oko becomes a creature the same turn he enters the battlefield, you can\'t attack with him or use any of his {T} abilities (if he gains any)."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Oko\'s second ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve. Damage that would be dealt to Oko won\'t be prevented."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If the target creature is copying something else, then Oko becomes a copy of whatever that creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Oko copies the printed values of the target creature. It won\'t copy counters on that creature or effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on. Notably, it won\'t copy effects that made the target creature become a creature if it isn\'t normally a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Oko\'s last ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t be 10/10."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "While Oko is a creature, he isn\'t a planeswalker. Damage dealt to him won\'t cause him to lose loyalty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "As long as Silverwing Squadron is on the battlefield, its ability will count itself, so it\'ll be at least 1/1."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, opponents who have left the game aren\'t counted by Silverwing Squadron\'s triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Silverwing Squadron\'s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "As long as Wintermoor Commander is on the battlefield, its ability will count itself, so it\'ll be at least 2/1."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Wintermoor Commander may become lethal if Knights you control leave the battlefield during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Wintermoor Commander\'s toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "As these lands are entering the battlefield, they check for lands that are already on the battlefield. They won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Scapeshift, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If another effect puts these lands onto the battlefield tapped, they enter tapped, even if you control enough lands with the appropriate basic land type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "As these lands are entering the battlefield, they check for lands that are already on the battlefield. They won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Scapeshift, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If another effect puts these lands onto the battlefield tapped, they enter tapped, even if you control enough lands with the appropriate basic land type.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "As you put the triggered ability of Outlaws\' Merriment on the stack, you choose a mode at random. Players can respond to the ability knowing which token will be created."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Glass Casket leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target creature won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist. Once the exiled creature returns, it\'s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Charming Prince\'s third mode can target any creature you own, including those another player controls."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Bartered Cow\'s ability is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn\'t allow you to discard it or sacrifice it whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of discarding it or causing it to die."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Because creatures with first strike deal combat damage before creatures without first strike, Keeper of Fables\'s ability can trigger twice during one combat if your creatures deal combat damage to one player at different times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If non-Human creatures you control deal combat damage to two or more players at the same time, Keeper of Fables\'s ability triggers for each of those players."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Keeper of Fables\'s ability triggers even if it\'s dealt lethal damage at the same time that non-Humans you control deal combat damage to a player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature may become lethal if Kenrith\'s Transformation becomes attached to it during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Effects that modify a creature\'s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Festive Funeral, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the affected creature gains an ability after Kenrith\'s Transformation becomes attached to it, it will keep that ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the creature Kenrith\'s Transformation would enchant is an illegal target by the time the Aura spell resolves, the entire spell doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Kenrith\'s Transformation may enchant a permanent that is only temporarily a creature, such as Enchanted Carriage. If this happens, the Aura\'s effect causes the enchanted permanent to remain a green Elk creature even after the temporary effect expires."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Kenrith\'s Transformation overwrites all colors and creature types the enchanted creature has. It\'s just a green Elk. The creature keeps any supertypes (such as legendary) it has, but loses any other card types it has (such as artifact)."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Kenrith\'s Transformation overwrites all previous effects that set the creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Kenrith\'s Transformation becomes attached to a creature will overwrite this effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature may become lethal if Oko\'s second ability changes its toughness during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Effects that modify a creature\'s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Festive Funeral, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a permanent doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it. Gaining control of an Equipment doesn\'t cause it to become unattached, although its new controller may activate its equip abilities during their main phase."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If either of the target permanents is an illegal target when Oko\'s last ability resolves, the exchange won\'t happen."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the affected creature gains an ability after Oko\'s second ability resolves, it will keep that ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Oko\'s second ability may target a permanent that is only temporarily an artifact or a creature, such as Oko, the Trickster. If this happens, the effect causes that permanent to remain a green Elk creature even after the temporary effect expires."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Oko\'s second ability overwrites all colors and creature types the affected creature has. It\'s just a green Elk. The creature keeps any supertypes (such as legendary) it has, but loses any other card types it has (such as artifact)."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Oko\'s second ability overwrites all previous effects that set the creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Oko\'s second ability resolves will overwrite this effect."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The effects of Oko\'s second ability lasts indefinitely. It doesn\'t expire during the cleanup step or if you or Oko leave the game."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The effects of Oko\'s third ability lasts indefinitely. It doesn\'t expire during the cleanup step or if the creature you take has its power raised above 3 later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Covetous Urge\'s effect doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an Adventure with Covetous Urge, it\'s you, not the card\'s owner, who may cast the creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the spell or permanent you control from Covetous Urge\'s effect is exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Escape to the Wilds doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled cards. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play a card exiled this way, it remains in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The additional land that you play doesn\'t have to be from among the exiled cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting the target card causes it to leave your graveyard and become a new object. You can\'t cast it again if it returns to your graveyard this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Emry\'s last ability targets an artifact land card, you can\'t play it. Effects that allow you to “cast” a card don\'t allow you to play a land card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting a spell, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change by how much Emry\'s cost is reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The cost reduction ability reduces only the generic mana in Emry\'s cost. The colored mana must still be paid."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Emry). The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions for the target artifact card. Unless it has flash, you\'ll most likely only be able to cast it during your main phase while the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You\'ll still pay all costs for a spell cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Chulane\'s triggered ability doesn\'t count as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if you\'ve already played your land for the turn, and even if it\'s not your turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Chulane\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Claim the Firstborn can target any creature with mana value 3 or less, even one that\'s untapped or one you already control."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a creature doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a creature on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Deafening Silence will look at the entire turn to see if a player has cast a noncreature spell yet that turn, even if Deafening Silence wasn\'t on the battlefield when that spell was cast. Notably, you can\'t cast Deafening Silence and then cast another noncreature spell that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast a noncreature spell that was countered, you can\'t cast another noncreature spell that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Players may cast any number of creature spells plus one noncreature spell each turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Deathless Knight must be in your graveyard immediately after you gain life for its last ability to trigger. If you gain life due to damage from a source with lifelink, and that damage is dealt at the same time that lethal damage is dealt to Deathless Knight, it won\'t be in your graveyard until state-based actions are performed a moment later, and so the ability can\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Deathless Knight enters your graveyard after you\'ve gained life in a turn, its last ability can\'t trigger during that turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Effects that modify a creature\'s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Festive Funeral, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Oko\'s Hospitality overwrites all previous effects that set the creatures\' base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Oko\'s Hospitality resolves will overwrite this effect."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You may cast Oko\'s Hospitality even if you control no creatures. You\'ll just search for Oko, the Trickster."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Faeburrow Elder\'s middle ability can give it at most +5/+5, that is, +1/+1 each for white, blue, black, red, and green. “Gold,” “multicolor,” and “colorless” aren\'t colors. Similarly, Faeburrow Elder\'s last ability can produce at most five mana."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Since Faeburrow Elder is a green and white permanent, its middle ability usually gives it at least +2/+2 and its last ability usually produces at least {G}{W}.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Fervent Champion\'s last ability reduces only the generic mana in equip abilities. If those costs are only {3}, {2}, or {1}, that equip ability will be free to activate if it targets Fervent Champion."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Festive Funeral is still on the stack while you determine the value of X. It doesn\'t contribute to the value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Festive Funeral begins to resolve. The target creature\'s power and toughness won\'t change if other cards are put into your graveyard later in the turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Fires of Invention doesn\'t impose any restrictions on playing lands or activating abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Fires of Invention will look at the entire turn to see if you\'ve cast two spells yet that turn, even if Fires of Invention wasn\'t on the battlefield when those spells were cast. Notably, you can\'t cast Fires of Invention and then cast two more spells that turn; if Fires of Invention was your second (or third, or fourth) spell that turn, you can\'t cast another spell at all."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect allows or instructs you to cast a spell during another player\'s turn, you can\'t do so. The restriction of Fires of Invention takes precedence over that permission. Similarly, if an effect allows or instructs you to cast a third spell during your turn, you can\'t do so."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect says that you may cast a card that you couldn\'t otherwise cast if you pay an alternative cost (such as the flashback keyword), you have to pay that alternative cost if you use that permission to cast the card. You can\'t choose to cast it but cast it without paying its mana cost."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs (such as that of Fling), you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell that was countered, it still counts as one of your two spells.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast one card twice during a turn (such as by casting it as an Adventure and then casting it from exile as a creature), you\'ve cast two spells."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You may choose to pay the mana cost or an alternative cost for spells you cast, even if their mana value is less than or equal to the number of lands you control.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Flutterfox gaining flying after it becomes blocked won\'t remove the blocking creature from combat or cause Flutterfox to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You control Auras that you put onto the battlefield attached to a permanent you don\'t control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, opponents who have left the game aren\'t counted by Gluttonous Troll\'s triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can sacrifice a Food token created by Gluttonous Troll\'s triggered ability to pay for the cost of its activated ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "No player may take actions between the time you announce you\'re activating Witch\'s Oven\'s ability and the time you sacrifice a creature. Notably, they can\'t try to remove or shrink the creature you\'d like to bake."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Some spells that instruct you to create a Food token have targets. You can\'t cast these spells without choosing all required targets, and if all of those targets become illegal targets, the spell won\'t resolve and you won\'t create any Food. If some but not all of those targets become illegal, you\'ll do as much as possible, including creating Food."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The triggered ability of Giant\'s Skewer triggers even if the equipped creature died, and even if the creature that was dealt damage didn\'t die."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Gingerbrute to activate the last ability of Tempting Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice more than two Foods to create more than one Giant token."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You choose whether to sacrifice two Foods as Giant Opportunity resolves, not as you cast it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Gingerbrute to activate the last ability of Tempting Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Gingerbrute to activate the last ability of Tempting Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If you cast a creature spell that enters the battlefield as a copy of Feasting Troll King, such as Clone, the enters-the-battlefield ability will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you put Feasting Troll King onto the battlefield from your hand without casting it, its enters-the-battlefield ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Thunderous Snapper\'s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a creature on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Gadwick\'s second ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Gadwick\'s triggered ability won\'t trigger when you cast it because it\'s not on the battlefield yet."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If Gadwick enters the battlefield without being cast, or if it was cast for a cost other than its mana cost, the value of X for its first ability is 0.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a creature doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a target of Rowan\'s second ability is a legal target but an effect prevents the damage that would be dealt to it, that creature still can\'t block this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Rowan\'s second ability can\'t target the same creature twice to deal 2 damage to it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Rowan\'s third ability can affect creatures you already control or ones that are already untapped. It will untap them if applicable and give them haste."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Gaining vigilance any time after the moment you choose to attack with a creature won\'t cause it to become untapped."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If there are no Knights to attach Shining Armor to when it enters the battlefield, it simply remains unattached.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Midnight Clock leaves the battlefield while its last ability is on the stack, it won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Midnight Clock\'s first triggered ability triggers at the beginning of each upkeep, not just your upkeep. In a Two-Headed Giant game, an ability that triggers at the beginning of each upkeep rather than each player\'s upkeep triggers only once during each team\'s upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Midnight Clock\'s last ability triggers after one or more counters are put onto it if it had fewer than twelve counters on it before those counters were put on it and it has twelve or more counters on it after."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can activate Midnight Clock\'s mana ability to pay the cost of its second ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Oathsworn Knight can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player\'s control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If damage that can\'t be prevented is dealt to Oathsworn Knight, one counter is still removed from it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If multiple sources would deal damage to Oathsworn Knight simultaneously (for example, multiple creatures blocking it), its last ability applies once. All of that damage is prevented, and only one counter is removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Oathsworn Knight\'s last ability removes only one counter from it each time it would be dealt damage, not one counter per 1 damage prevented."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Opportunistic Dragon leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, your opponent keeps control of their Human or artifact, it doesn\'t lose any abilities, and it can still attack or block as normal. You don\'t gain control of it at all."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If another player gains control of the permanent Opportunistic Dragon has kidnapped, that permanent doesn\'t regain its abilities and still can\'t attack or block."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the stolen permanent normally has any abilities that would trigger when Opportunistic Dragon dies, those abilities won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Opportunistic Dragon\'s effect doesn\'t expire if another player gains control of it or if it loses all abilities. The effect only expires once it\'s no longer on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Sorcerer\'s Broom leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the token will still enter the battlefield as a copy of Sorcerer\'s Broom, using Sorcerer\'s Broom\'s copiable values from when it was last on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice Sorcerer\'s Broom and another permanent at the same time, Sorcerer\'s Broom\'s ability triggers for that permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The ability of Sorcerer\'s Broom is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn\'t allow you to sacrifice a permanent whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of sacrificing permanents, such as the activated ability of Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The token will have Sorcerer\'s Broom\'s ability. It will also be able to create copies of itself."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The token won\'t copy counters, Auras, or Equipment on Sorcerer\'s Broom, nor will it copy other effects that have changed Sorcerer\'s Broom\'s power, toughness, types, color, and so on. Normally, this means the token will simply be a Sorcerer\'s Broom, but if any copy effects have affected that Sorcerer\'s Broom, they\'re taken into account."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "While resolving the triggered ability of Sorcerer\'s Broom, you can\'t pay {3} multiple times to create more than one token. However, if you control more than one Sorcerer\'s Broom, you can pay {3} for each of their abilities."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Syr Carah or an instant or sorcery spell you control deals damage to two or more players at the same time, Syr Carah\'s first ability triggers for each of those players."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play the exiled card, it remains in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Playing an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t play it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Syr Carah doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Syr Carah\'s first ability triggers even if Syr Carah is dealt lethal damage at the same time that it or an instant or sorcery spell you control deals damage to a player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Weapon Rack has left the battlefield or has no +1/+1 counters on it by the time its activated ability resolves, you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on the target creature. If the creature becomes an illegal target or can\'t have a +1/+1 counter put onto it for some other reason, you won\'t remove a +1/+1 counter from Weapon Rack."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once Weapon Rack runs out of +1/+1 counters, it remains on the battlefield. You can activate its last ability, but it won\'t do anything."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The +1/+1 counters on Weapon Rack won\'t affect it unless it somehow becomes a creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a Knight you control is dealt lethal damage at the same time as Venerable Knight, they die at the same time. That Knight can\'t receive a counter from Venerable Knight\'s ability in time to save it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack. This means that you can\'t use one Crystal Slipper to allow two new creatures to attack in the same combat."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a player sacrifices a creature for any other reason (perhaps because it\'s a Food and the player was hungry), Clackbridge Troll\'s ability won\'t tap it or cause you to gain life or draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When Clackbridge Troll\'s last ability resolves, the next opponent in turn order chooses whether they want to sacrifice a creature at all and which creature to sacrifice if so, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time. If one or more creatures were sacrificed this way, Clackbridge Troll is tapped and you gain 3 life and draw a card—you don\'t gain more life or draw more cards if more than one creature was sacrificed."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it\'s not a card drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to draw multiple cards, the ability triggers after you draw whichever is the second one for the turn. You choose a target (if any) for the ability after you\'ve drawn and looked at all of the cards and finished resolving the spell or ability that caused you to draw them."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Mantle of Tides\'s triggered ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve. Mantle of Tides remains attached to what it was attached to or remains unattached if it wasn\'t attached."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The triggered ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn\'t matter whether the permanent with that ability was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn. If it\'s not on the battlefield when the second card is drawn, the ability can\'t trigger at all that turn. It won\'t trigger when the third or fourth card is drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The triggered ability of Mantle of Tides can target the creature it\'s already attached to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it\'s not a card drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to draw multiple cards, the ability triggers after you draw whichever is the second one for the turn. You choose a target (if any) for the ability after you\'ve drawn and looked at all of the cards and finished resolving the spell or ability that caused you to draw them."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The triggered ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn\'t matter whether the permanent with that ability was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn. If it\'s not on the battlefield when the second card is drawn, the ability can\'t trigger at all that turn. It won\'t trigger when the third or fourth card is drawn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an attacking creature with double strike and trample destroys all of its blocking creatures with first-strike combat damage, all of its normal combat damage is assigned to the player or planeswalker that creature\'s attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If there are no creatures to attach Embercleave to when it enters the battlefield, it simply remains unattached.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast Embercleave outside of your combat phase, its cost won\'t be reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting a spell, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change by how much a relic\'s cost is reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The cost reduction ability reduces only the generic mana in the relic\'s cost. The colored mana must still be paid."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect allows or instructs you to cast another spell after you cast one more, you can\'t do so. The restriction of Irencrag Feat takes precedence over that permission."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Irencrag Feat\'s effect doesn\'t allow you to cast any spell you couldn\'t otherwise cast. For example, if an effect says you can\'t cast more than one spell each turn, Irencrag Feat won\'t let you cast a second."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Irencrag Feat\'s effect doesn\'t care how many spells you\'ve cast so far in the turn. You can cast only one more."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Irencrag Feat\'s effect doesn\'t stop you from activating any abilities or from playing lands."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Lucky Clover can copy any Adventure spell, not just one with targets.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Lucky Clover\'s ability and the copy it creates both resolve before the Adventure spell. They resolve even if the Adventure spell is countered before the copy is created."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The copy is created on the stack, so it\'s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a “[subtype] spell,” it refers only to a spell that has that subtype. For example, Knights\' Charge is a card with “Knight” in its name and benefits Knights, but it isn\'t a Knight card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Mana produced by the second ability of Tournament Grounds can\'t be spent to activate abilities, including equip abilities."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a “[subtype] spell,” it refers only to a spell that has that subtype. For example, Knights\' Charge is a card with “Knight” in its name and benefits Knights, but it isn\'t a Knight card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Worthy Knight\'s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Worthy Knight\'s triggered ability won\'t trigger when you cast it because it\'s not on the battlefield yet."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If another effect modifies how much damage your red source would deal, including preventing some of it, the player being dealt damage or the controller of the permanent being dealt damage chooses an order in which to apply those effects. If all of the damage is prevented, Torbran\'s effect no longer applies."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If damage dealt by a source you control is being divided or assigned among multiple permanents an opponent controls or among an opponent and one or more permanents they control, divide the original amount before adding 2. For example, if you attack with a 5/5 red creature with trample and your opponent blocks with a 2/2 creature, you can assign 2 damage to the blocker and 3 damage to the defending player. These amounts are then modified to 4 and 5, respectively.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The additional 2 damage is dealt by the same source as the original source of damage. The damage isn\'t dealt by Torbran unless Torbran is the original source of damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If lethal damage is dealt to one of Garruk\'s Wolf tokens at the same time that Garruk\'s loyalty is brought to 0 or less, Garruk is put into your graveyard before the Wolf\'s triggered ability can save him."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Garruk\'s second ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve. You won\'t draw a card. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you will still draw."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If more than one Knight enters the battlefield under your control at once, Brimstone Trebuchet\'s last ability triggers for each of them. Players may take actions, such as activating its activated ability, in between each of those triggered abilities resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Brimstone Trebuchet\'s activated ability causes it to deal 1 damage twice."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If more than one non-Human creature enters the battlefield at the same time, Sage of the Falls\'s ability triggers that many times. You\'ll resolve the abilities one at a time—you won\'t draw that many cards at once and then discard that many cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You draw a card and discard a card all while Sage of the Falls\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If that player has one card in hand, it\'s discarded at random (even though that\'s not very random). The player draws a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the entering green creature dies before Yorvo\'s triggered ability resolves, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine whether Yorvo gets a second +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Yorvo\'s triggered ability compares the power of the entering green creature only after putting a +1/+1 counter on Yorvo. If that counter causes Yorvo\'s power to be greater than or equal to the entering creature\'s power, it won\'t get a second +1/+1 counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the opponent dealt damage controls no planeswalkers, Questing Beast\'s last ability simply does nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked this creature, changing the power of the blocking creature won\'t cause this creature to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Questing Beast only stops combat damage from being prevented by effects that specifically use the word “prevent.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The damage Questing Beast deals to the target planeswalker as its last ability resolves isn\'t combat damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target artifact or enchantment is an illegal target by the time True Love\'s Kiss tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t draw a card or live happily ever after."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target attacking creature is an illegal target by the time Barge In tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. Your attacking non-Human creatures won\'t gain trample."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target when Thorn Mammoth\'s last ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. If Thorn Mammoth is no longer on the battlefield, the target creature won\'t deal or be dealt damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target nonland permanent is an illegal target by the time Banish into Fable tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t create a Knight token."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you control one permanent that\'s an artifact and an enchantment, you\'ll copy Banish into Fable twice."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that copies Banish into Fable resolves and creates copies of Banish into Fable even if Banish into Fable is countered. The ability and the copies resolve before Banish into Fable itself resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Whether you control an artifact and/or an enchantment is checked only as the triggered ability resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If there is somehow no chosen color, Heraldic Banner\'s static ability has no effect, and its mana ability produces no mana if you activate it. Colorless creatures won\'t get +1/+0, and you won\'t add {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must choose white, blue, black, red, or green for Heraldic Banner\'s ability. You can\'t choose “multicolor,” “gold,” or “colorless.”"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you choose any target creature cards and they are all illegal targets by the time Forever Young tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You can cast Forever Young with no targets if you just want to draw a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You choose the order that the creature cards are put on top of your library. You don\'t have to reveal this order to other players. Whichever ends up on top will be the card you draw."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you control another player\'s commander, you won\'t put a page counter on Tome of Legends when you attack with that creature. Similarly, if another player controls your commander, you\'ll still put a page counter on Tome of Legends if it attacks. (Perhaps the page is about your commander\'s shocking betrayal.)"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control another non-Human creature immediately after Wildwood Tracker attacks or blocks, its ability doesn\'t trigger at all. If you don\'t control one as the ability resolves, the ability does nothing. It doesn\'t matter whether you control a non-Human creature in between those times, or whether you still control one later in the turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you have no cards in hand, you won\'t have to exile anything if you have the player exile a nonblack card from their hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you pay {X} while Wildborn Preserver\'s triggered ability is resolving, the reflexive triggered ability triggers and will resolve separately. This is different from effects that say “If you do . . .” in that players may take actions after you\'ve paid mana but before the creature gets +1/+1 counters."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Ignore the alternative characteristics of an adventurer card in your graveyard. Its alternative card type won\'t be counted among the card types of cards in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Happily Ever After\'s first ability causes each team to gain 5 life twice."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Lands are normally colorless permanents, even if they tap for mana of a certain color.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Players can\'t take any actions during your turn before your upkeep begins."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The card types that could appear among your permanents and cards in your graveyard are artifact, creature, enchantment, instant, land, planeswalker, and sorcery. Certain older sets contain tribal cards as well. Supertypes, such as legendary and basic, aren\'t card types."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The second triggered ability of Happily Ever After has one very long intervening “if” clause. This means that all of the conditions must be true as your upkeep begins—you must control permanents with all five colors, your permanents and graveyard must contain six or more card types, and your life total must be high enough—or the ability won\'t trigger at all. If they\'re not all true as the ability resolves, you won\'t win the game."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You could have one permanent that\'s all five colors, or the five colors could be spread out among any number of permanents."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Ayara\'s first ability causes the opposing team to lose 1 life twice, and you gain 1 life once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Knights\' Charge\'s first ability causes the opposing team to lose 1 life twice, and you gain 1 life once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Stormfist Crusader\'s triggered ability causes each team to lose 1 life twice after each player on that team has drawn a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, opponents who have left the game aren\'t counted by Chittering Witch\'s triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You can sacrifice Chittering Witch to pay the cost of its last ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, opponents who have left the game before the ability resolves aren\'t counted by Embereth Skyblazer\'s triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Embereth Skyblazer\'s triggered ability resolves. It doesn\'t change later in the turn if opponents leave the game."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "While resolving Embereth Skyblazer\'s triggered ability, you can\'t pay {2}{R} multiple times to increase the bonus."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Into the Story\'s cost reduction can only reduce its cost by {3}. It doesn\'t reduce the cost further if more than one opponent has seven cards in their graveyard or if an opponent has fourteen cards in their graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Into the Story). The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Kenrith\'s first ability affects only creatures on the battlefield at the time it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn won\'t gain trample or haste."}, {\'date\': \'2023-04-14\', \'text\': \'Kenrith’s last ability can target a creature card in any player’s graveyard. Its owner will control the creature, and it will remain on the battlefield even if you leave the game (if you don’t own it).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Moonlit Scavengers\'s ability doesn\'t return multiple creatures if you control multiple artifacts and/or enchantments."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Moonlit Scavengers\'s ability won\'t trigger at all if you don\'t control an artifact or enchantment immediately after it enters the battlefield. If you don\'t control an artifact or enchantment as the ability resolves, the ability has no effect. These don\'t have the be the same artifact or enchantment at both times, however."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You still control Auras that you put onto the battlefield attached to a permanent you don\'t control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once The Great Henge\'s last ability has triggered, you\'ll draw a card even if you can\'t put a +1/+1 counter on the creature for some reason (most likely because it has left the battlefield)."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting a spell, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change by how much a relic\'s cost is reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Once you determine the cost to cast The Great Henge, you may activate mana abilities to pay that cost. If the greatest power among creatures you control changes while activating mana abilities, the cost to cast The Great Henge remains what you previously determined.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The cost reduction ability reduces only the generic mana in the relic\'s cost. The colored mana must still be paid."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'The first step of casting a spell is to move it to the stack. If this causes the greatest power among creatures you control to change, that new power will be used to determine the cost reduction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once Wishclaw Talisman runs out of wish counters, it remains on the battlefield. You can\'t activate its last ability at all."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You choose which opponent gains control of Wishclaw Talisman while its ability is resolving. If that player later leaves the game, you regain control of Wishclaw Talisman.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 2 or less has blocked this creature, changing the power of the blocking creature won\'t cause this creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting a spell, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change by how much a relic\'s cost is reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The Circle of Loyalty\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The Circle of Loyalty\'s triggered ability won\'t trigger when you cast it because it\'s not on the battlefield yet."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The cost reduction ability reduces only the generic mana in the relic\'s cost. The colored mana must still be paid."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting a spell, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change by how much a relic\'s cost is reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The cost reduction ability reduces only the generic mana in the relic\'s cost. The colored mana must still be paid."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Players can\'t take any actions between the time you choose whether to tap a creature and the time Redcap Raiders gets +1/+1 and gains trample."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Tapping an attacking creature with vigilance to pay the cost of Redcap Raiders\'s ability won\'t cause that creature to leave combat or to stop attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "While resolving the ability of Redcap Raiders, you can\'t tap more than one creature to get +1/+1 more than once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Scorching Dragonfire\'s replacement effect will exile the target creature or planeswalker if it would die this turn for any reason, not just due to lethal damage. It applies to the target creature or planeswalker even if Scorching Dragonfire deals no damage to it (most likely due to a prevention effect)."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Scorching Dragonfire\'s replacement effect will exile the target creature or planeswalker if it would die this turn for any reason, not just due to lethal damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "So Tiny continuously checks the enchanted creature\'s controller\'s graveyard to determine just how tiny the enchanted creature is."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Syr Elenora\'s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of an opponent\'s spell that targets Syr Elenora, start with the mana cost or alternative cost that player is paying, add any cost increases (such as that of Syr Elenora\'s effect), then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The control-change effect of Piper of the Swarm\'s last ability lasts indefinitely. It doesn\'t wear off during the cleanup step, and it doesn\'t expire if Piper of the Swarm leaves the battlefield. In a multiplayer game, it does expire if you leave the game."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The earliest opportunity you have to cast Once Upon a Time is during the first player\'s upkeep, before that player can play a land."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The triggered ability of Revenge of Ravens resolves before any abilities the attacking player controls. If this causes the attacking player to lose the game, that player\'s triggered abilities won\'t resolve and no combat damage will be dealt."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "To choose a creature type, you must choose an existing creature type, such as Human or Knight. You can\'t choose multiple creature types, such as “Human Knight,” but choosing “Human” is enough to affect a Human Knight. Card types such as artifact can\'t be chosen; nor can supertypes such as legendary; nor can subtypes that aren\'t creature types, such as Vehicle."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Witch\'s Vengeance affects only creatures of the chosen type that are on the battlefield at the time it resolves. This includes creatures you control, creatures with hexproof, and creatures with protection from black. Creatures that enter the battlefield or become the chosen type later in the turn won\'t get -3/-3."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You choose a creature type as Witch\'s Vengeance resolves, not as you cast it. No player may take actions between the time you choose a creature type and the time those creatures get -3/-3."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "While Wishful Merfolk is a Human, it\'s no longer a Merfolk."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can activate Locthwain Gargoyle\'s ability multiple times during one turn, even if it already has flying."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You scry 2 once after each opponent has moved the top cards of their library. You don\'t scry 2 for each opponent."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'A creature with an Adventure you control that would enter the battlefield with no +1/+1 counters on it enters with one +1/+1 counter on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that “has an Adventure.” This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card\'s set of alternative characteristics, even if they\'re not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a creature card, creature spell, or creature that has an Adventure, it won\'t find an instant or sorcery spell on the stack that\'s been cast as an Adventure."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'A non-Human creature you control that would enter the battlefield with no +1/+1 counters on it enters with one +1/+1 counter on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Any other non-Human creatures that enter the battlefield at the same time as Grumgully won\'t get a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a non-Human creature enters the battlefield as a copy of a Human creature, it won\'t get a +1/+1 counter. Similarly, if a Human enters as a non-Human creature, it will get a +1/+1 counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Gingerbrute to activate the last ability of Tempting Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "While resolving the second triggered ability, you can\'t pay {1} multiple times to look at more cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied permanent will trigger when Mirrormade enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen permanent will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Mirrormade copies an Aura this way, you choose what the Aura will enchant just before it enters the battlefield. You can\'t choose any permanent cards entering the battlefield at the same time as that Aura. This doesn\'t target the player or permanent it will enchant, so an opponent\'s permanent with hexproof may be chosen this way. The chosen recipient must be able to legally be enchanted by the Aura, so a player or permanent with protection from one of the Aura\'s qualities can\'t be chosen this way. If there\'s nothing legal for Mirrormade to enchant, it stays in its current zone (unless it\'s a spell, in which case it\'s put into its owner\'s graveyard)."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Mirrormade somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another artifact or enchantment, it can\'t become a copy of that permanent. You may choose only a permanent that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If the chosen permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the chosen permanent is a token, Mirrormade copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Mirrormade doesn\'t become a token in this case."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If the chosen permanent is copying something else (for example, if the chosen permanent is another Mirrormade), then Mirrormade enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen permanent copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Mirrormade copies exactly what was printed on the original permanent (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its types, color, or so on. Notably, if Mirrormade copies an artifact creature or enchantment creature that\'s normally not a creature (such as one affected by Bring to Life), Mirrormade won\'t be a creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'As Taste of Death resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses three creatures they control, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a player controls three or fewer creatures, that player sacrifices each creature they control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You create three Food tokens, no matter how many creatures were actually sacrificed, even if some or all players sacrificed no creatures.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'As the first mode is performed, first the player whose turn it is chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then each other player in turn order does the same. Then all the chosen cards are discarded at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'As the third mode is performed, first the player whose turn it chooses a creature they control, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'For each chosen mode, perform that mode in its entirety before continuing on to the next chosen mode in the order printed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you really want, you can choose zero modes for Rankle\'s triggered ability, but carefully consider the hidden costs in not entertaining someone titled Master of Pranks."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Rankle\'s second mode causes each team to lose 1 life twice."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You can choose a mode even if some or all players will be unaffected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose a mode more than once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to creatures may become lethal if Harmonious Archon enters or leaves the battlefield during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Effects that modify a creature\'s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Festive Funeral, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Harmonious Archon overwrites all previous effects that set a creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Harmonious Archon enters the battlefield will overwrite this effect."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect causes a noncreature permanent to become a creature and sets its power and toughness as it does so, that creature will have that power and toughness; it won\'t be 3/3. Notably, crewing a Vehicle does not set its power and toughness, so a Vehicle will be a 3/3 creature once crewed."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to one Seven Dwarves may become lethal if another Seven Dwarves you control leaves the battlefield during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you\'re fortunate enough to open or draft eight or more Seven Dwarves during a Limited event, you can include only seven of them in your deck. The rest remain in your sideboard."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The last ability of Seven Dwarves lets you ignore the “four-of” rule. It doesn\'t let you ignore format legality. For example, during a Throne of Eldraine Limited event, you can\'t add Seven Dwarves from your personal collection, no matter how happy they would be."}]', "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'Blacklance Paragon can be the target of its own triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'Count the number of creatures you control as Outflank resolves to determine how much damage Outflank deals.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'During your upkeep, you can sacrifice Doom Foretold for its own ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Doom Foretold leaves the battlefield or changes control while its ability is on the stack, its effect still happens. You just won\'t be able to sacrifice it if instructed to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the player can sacrifice a nonland, nontoken permanent, that player must do so. They can\'t choose to rush toward their doom."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the player is unable to sacrifice a permanent and is unable to discard a card, they still lose 2 life, and the rest of Doom Foretold\'s effects happen."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Doom Foretold\'s ability triggers twice during a team\'s upkeep. In any order you\'d like, each of those players has to sacrifice a permanent. The full consequences happen if that player can\'t, even if you sacrifice Doom Foretold as the first triggered ability is resolving."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Each chosen target must receive at least 1 damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to cast Sundering Stroke without paying its mana cost, you can\'t choose to cast it and pay its cost unless another rule or effect allows you to cast it for a cost."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If some of the targets become illegal for Sundering Stroke, the original division of damage still applies, but the damage that would have been dealt to illegal targets isn\'t dealt at all."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Sundering Stroke checks what mana was actually spent to cast it. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that will allow you to spend mana you couldn\'t otherwise spend, but it won\'t change what mana you spent to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You must divide the damage as you announce Sundering Stroke, even if you intend to pay seven red mana to cast it. If you copy Sundering Stroke, no mana was spent to cast the copy at all, so the copy will deal the damage as divided.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Equipment you control still have their other equip abilities in addition to equip Knight {0}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If Syr Gwyn leaves the battlefield after an equip Knight ability has been activated, that ability still resolves even though the Equipment has lost that ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Syr Gwyn\'s triggered ability triggers once per attacking creature that\'s equipped, regardless of how many Equipment those creatures each carry."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Whether the target creature is a Knight is checked only as the equip Knight ability is activated and as that ability resolves. If the creature somehow becomes a non-Knight creature later, the Equipment remains attached to it.\'}]', "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'If Bloodhaze Wolverine gains first strike after first-strike combat damage has been dealt, it will just deal regular combat damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'If Elite Headhunter somehow becomes an artifact, you can sacrifice it to pay the cost of its activated ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If Syr Faren leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine the value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Syr Faren\'s power is negative as its triggered ability resolves, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Syr Faren\'s triggered ability resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won\'t change later in the turn even if Syr Faren\'s power changes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If Vantress Gargoyle attacks a planeswalker, the controller of that planeswalker is the defending player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Vantress Gargoyle\'s attacking and blocking restrictions are checked only at the moment that you declare it as an attacking or blocking creature. If the defending player loses cards from their graveyard after Vantress Gargoyle attacks, or if you lose cards from your hand after it blocks, it remains in combat."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If Wicked Guardian leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, you may still have it deal 2 damage to another creature you control and draw a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If the damage Wicked Guardian deals is prevented (perhaps because you chose for it to deal 2 damage to a creature with protection from black), you still draw a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'No player may take actions between the time you choose which creature (if any) is dealt damage and the time you draw a card if you chose one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "While resolving Wicked Guardian\'s triggered ability, you can\'t have it deal 2 damage multiple times or to multiple creatures to draw more cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a creature on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Stolen by the Fae tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Faerie tokens."}]', "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'If a creature on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a player has fewer than X cards in their library, that player loses the game after the first ability of Folio of Fancies resolves. If each player loses the game this way, the game is a draw.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "It\'s not possible to pay {X}{X}{2}{U} and activate both abilities of Folio of Fancies. You\'ll need to find a way to untap it to activate both abilities during one turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'To pay {X}{X}, choose a value for X, and pay twice that much mana.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Gingerbrute to activate the last ability of Tempting Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target creature can block other creatures but can\'t block Maraleaf Rider, it\'s free to block any other creature or to not block at all."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target creature can\'t block for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn\'t block. If there\'s a cost associated with having it block, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to block in that case either."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Gingerbrute to activate the last ability of Tempting Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Insatiable Appetite tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t sacrifice a Food."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You choose a target creature as you cast Insatiable Appetite, but you don\'t choose whether to sacrifice a Food until the spell resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Gingerbrute to activate the last ability of Tempting Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target when Wicked Wolf\'s first ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. If Wicked Wolf is no longer on the battlefield, the target creature won\'t deal or be dealt damage."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can activate Wicked Wolf\'s last ability any number of times while its first ability is on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can activate Wicked Wolf\'s last ability even if it\'s already tapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Gingerbrute to activate the last ability of Tempting Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Cauldron Familiar\'s first ability causes the opposing team to lose 1 life twice, and you gain 1 life once."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate Cauldron Familiar\'s last ability unless it\'s in your graveyard."}]', "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Gingerbrute to activate the last ability of Tempting Witch.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If either target is an illegal target as Joust tries to resolve, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the creature you control is an illegal target as Joust tries to resolve, no creature gets +2/+1. If that creature is a legal target but the creature you don\'t control isn\'t, it still gets +2/+1 until end of turn if it\'s a Knight."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The target creature you control gets +2/+1 only if it\'s a Knight as Joust resolves. It\'ll still fight if it doesn\'t get +2/+1."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Joust unless you choose both a creature you control and a creature you don\'t control as targets."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If one or more creatures die at the same time as Syr Konrad, its first ability triggers for each of those creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Syr Konrad\'s first ability causes it to deal 1 damage twice."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If replacement effects cause you to draw five or more cards while resolving the last ability of The Royal Scions, its reflexive triggered ability still triggers only once, even if you draw eight cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you draw fewer than four cards while resolving the last ability of The Royal Scions, its reflexive triggered ability doesn\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The Royal Scions\'s last ability goes on the stack without a target. While that ability is resolving, you draw four cards. When you do, the reflexive triggered ability triggers and you pick a target to be dealt damage. This is different from effects that say “If you do . . .” in that you choose a target after looking at the cards you draw."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You draw a card and discard a card all while The Royal Scions\'s first ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions."}]', "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'If there are no creatures to attach Rosethorn Halberd to when it enters the battlefield, it simply remains unattached.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'In a Two-Headed Giant game, creatures can attack your teammate and planeswalkers your teammate controls without requiring a mana payment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Your opponents can choose not to pay to attack with a creature that attacks “if able.” If there\'s no other player or planeswalker to attack, that creature simply doesn\'t attack."}]', "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink or indestructible on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'No player may take actions between the time you draw a card and the time you lose life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to interfere with the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The sacrificed creature\'s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you can\'t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can\'t sacrifice additional creatures."}]', "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'The equipped creature has vigilance even if Mace of the Valiant has no charge counters on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'Whether the target creature is a Knight is checked only as the equip Knight ability is activated and as that ability resolves. If the creature somehow becomes a non-Knight creature later, Steelclaw Lance remains attached to it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you control four or more lands, the basic land doesn\'t enter the battlefield untapped; it enters tapped and then you untap it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'The land that you put onto the battlefield will be counted when determining whether you control four or more lands, but Fabled Passage will not.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature may become lethal if Frogify becomes attached to it during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Effects that modify a creature\'s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Dead Weight, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Frogify may enchant a permanent that is only temporarily a creature, such as a Vehicle. If this happens, Frogify\'s effect causes the enchanted permanent to remain a 1/1 blue Frog creature even after the temporary effect expires."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Frogify overwrites all colors and creature types the enchanted creature has. It\'s just a blue Frog. The creature keeps any supertypes (such as legendary) it has, but loses any other card types it has (such as artifact)."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Frogify overwrites all previous effects that set the creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Frogify becomes attached to a creature will overwrite this effect."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If the affected creature gains an ability after Frogify becomes attached to it, it will keep that ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If both creatures are controlled by the same player as Run Away Together tries to resolve, both targets are illegal. The spell doesn\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If one of the two target creatures becomes an illegal target, Run Away Together can still determine its controller only to check whether the other creature is a legal target. If the illegal target has left the battlefield, use its last known information. If the other creature is still a legal target, it\'s returned to its owner\'s hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Triggered abilities (starting with "when," "whenever," or "at") are unaffected by the last ability of Sorcerous Spyglass.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'An activated mana ability is one that produces mana as it resolves, not one that costs mana to activate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Sorcerous Spyglass affects cards regardless of what zone they\'re in. This includes cards in hand, cards in the graveyard, and exiled cards."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can choose any card name, even if that card doesn\'t normally have an activated ability. You\'re not limited to the names of cards you saw in the opponent\'s hand."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose the name of a token unless that token has the same name as a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "You must discard exactly one card to cast Thrill of Possibility; you can\'t cast it without discarding a card, and you can\'t discard additional cards."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Alles, was glänzt\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jedes Artefakt und/oder jede Verzauberung, das bzw. die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Die Freude einer Fee über ihren Schatz verblasst schnell zu Zufriedenheit, dann zu Langeweile. Schließlich wird daraus der Drang, etwas Neues zu stehlen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473233&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c070e67d-81e3-4085-bf32-6b515328629e\', \'multiverseId\': 473233}, \'multiverseid\': 473233}, {\'name\': \'Todo lo que reluce\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 por cada artefacto y/o encantamiento que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'La alegría de un hada al conseguir su tesoro se desvanece rápidamente para convertirse en satisfacción, después aburrimiento y por último en la necesidad de robar otro poquito más.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c965d2c3-954f-411d-b7f0-5cafd49156ec\', \'multiverseId\': 473502}, \'multiverseid\': 473502}, {\'name\': \'Tout ce qui brille\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque artefact et/ou enchantement que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Une færie se délecte de son trésor avant de s\'en contenter, de s\'en lasser, puis de ressentir le besoin d\'en voler davantage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473771&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42817de9-380f-4fc3-97cd-62423b87cd6f\', \'multiverseId\': 473771}, \'multiverseid\': 473771}, {\'name\': \'Quel che Luccica\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 per ogni artefatto e/o incantesimo che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "La gioia di una spiritella per il suo tesoro ben presto si riduce a soddisfazione, poi a noia, infine a un impulso a rubare qualcos\'altro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb41a4f8-3cbe-4088-a451-5e39a3ca5d57\', \'multiverseId\': 474040}, \'multiverseid\': 474040}, {\'name\': \'きらきらするすべて\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトやエンチャント１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'宝に埋もれたフェアリーの興奮はすぐに満足へと変わり、そして退屈となり、やがて更なる盗みへの原動力となった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c49fafe8-1d0e-433e-80bd-9c8f16453d9d\', \'multiverseId\': 474309}, \'multiverseid\': 474309}, {\'name\': \'반짝이는 모든 것들\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 당신이 조종하는 마법물체 및/또는 부여마법 한 개당 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'자신의 보물을 바라보고 있던 페어리의 환희는 빠르게 만족감으로, 그 다음에는 지루함으로 변해 가다가, 이내 더 훔치고 싶은 욕망으로 변했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48b9b925-cdd8-40f1-a58c-6c4c3c618fa7\', \'multiverseId\': 474578}, \'multiverseid\': 474578}, {\'name\': \'Tudo que Reluz\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 para cada artefato e/ou encantamento que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'A exultação de uma fada com o próprio tesouro logo se torna contentamento, que vira tédio e, em seguida, compulsão por roubar mais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73a03b83-c714-4746-9245-c8afee4d6855\', \'multiverseId\': 474847}, \'multiverseid\': 474847}, {\'name\': \'Все, Что Блестит\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1 за каждый артефакт и (или) чары под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Восторг феи от обладания сокровищами быстро утихает и превращается в удовлетворение, потом в скуку, а потом в стремление наворовать еще больше.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f138d8b-16c1-4268-ab56-6a2dab323c05\', \'multiverseId\': 475116}, \'multiverseid\': 475116}, {\'name\': \'闪光宝物\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n你每操控一个神器和／或结界，所结附的生物便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'新有收获，仙灵都会笑逐颜开，但这种心情很快平复，继而生厌，接着就又打起再度行窃的念头。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84b43147-b233-4218-9d82-bc478e254638\', \'multiverseId\': 475385}, \'multiverseid\': 475385}, {\'name\': \'閃光寶物\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n你每操控一個神器和／或結界，所結附的生物便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'新有收穫，仙靈都會笑逐顏開，但這種心情很快平復，繼而生厭，接著就又打起再度行竊的念頭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0aadad2-d163-42ea-b6b2-93f94c56eced\', \'multiverseId\': 475654}, \'multiverseid\': 475654}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archon der Absolution\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSchutz vor Weiß (Diese Kreatur kann von nichts Weißem geblockt oder als Ziel bestimmt werden, von ihm Schaden zugefügt bekommen oder von ihm verzaubert oder ausgerüstet werden.)\\nKreaturen können weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {1} für jede dieser Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473234&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'690b02e2-ce4a-4d5f-a38d-d6e8123f03bd\', \'multiverseId\': 473234}, \'multiverseid\': 473234}, {\'name\': \'Arconte de la absolución\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nProtección contra blanco. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada, hecha objetivo, recibir daño, estar encantada o ser equipada por nada blanco.)\\nLas criaturas no pueden atacarte a ti o a un planeswalker que controlas a menos que su controlador pague {1} por cada una de esas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'872c986c-3966-4053-9b1d-9a92d551d0cc\', \'multiverseId\': 473503}, \'multiverseid\': 473503}, {\'name\': "Archonte de l\'absolution", \'text\': \'Vol\\nProtection contre le blanc (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée, ciblée, blessée, enchantée ou équipée par quoi que ce soit de blanc.)\\nLes créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer ou attaquer un planeswalker que vous contrôlez à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {1} pour chacune de ces créatures.\', \'type\': \'Créature : archonte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473772&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62ce6396-61f2-46d9-bdcc-c0dbdff4b5fa\', \'multiverseId\': 473772}, \'multiverseid\': 473772}, {\'name\': "Arconte dell\'Assoluzione", \'text\': \'Volare\\nProtezione dal bianco (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata, bersagliata, non le può essere inflitto danno, né può essere incantata o equipaggiata da nulla di bianco.)\\nLe creature non possono attaccare te o un planeswalker che controlli a meno che il loro controllore non paghi {1} per ognuna di quelle creature.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'782269d8-a04f-4e84-868d-fe03293ed610\', \'multiverseId\': 474041}, \'multiverseid\': 474041}, {\'name\': \'赦免のアルコン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nプロテクション（白）（このクリーチャーは白のものによっては、ブロックされず、対象にならず、ダメージを与えられず、エンチャントされず、装備されない。）\\nあなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃するクリーチャー１体につきそのコントローラーが{1}を支払わないかぎり、その攻撃はできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b9efa51-ed1e-4e61-b132-6b614cc1de9b\', \'multiverseId\': 474310}, \'multiverseid\': 474310}, {\'name\': \'면죄의 집정관\', \'text\': \'비행\\n백색으로부터 보호 (이 생물은 백색 원천에게 방어될 수 없고, 백색 원천의 목표로 정해질 수 없고, 백색 원천으로부터 피해를 입지 않고, 백색 원천이 부여되거나 장착될 수 없다.)\\n각 생물은 그 생물의 조종자가 {1}을 지불하지 않는 한 당신 또는 당신이 조종하는 플레인즈워커를 공격할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 집정관\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5209b45b-a964-49eb-a399-025a8184fb0d\', \'multiverseId\': 474579}, \'multiverseid\': 474579}, {\'name\': \'Arconte da Absolvição\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nProteção contra o branco (Esta criatura não pode ser bloqueada, ser alvo, sofrer dano, ser encantada nem equipada por nada branco.)\\nAs criaturas não podem atacar você nem um planeswalker que você controla, a menos que seu controlador pague {1} para cada uma daquelas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ac6f903-878a-46be-a6c5-c1ac3b9c4193\', \'multiverseId\': 474848}, \'multiverseid\': 474848}, {\'name\': \'Архонт Отпущения\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nЗащита от белого (Белые объекты не могут блокировать это существо, делать его своей целью, наносить ему повреждения, зачаровывать или снаряжать.)\\nСущества не могут атаковать вас или planeswalker-а под вашим контролем, если только контролирующий их игрок не заплатит {1} за каждое из тех существ.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Архонт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eac7f908-bc7f-4b05-b4c2-85456664ad4c\', \'multiverseId\': 475117}, \'multiverseid\': 475117}, {\'name\': \'赦免统领\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n反白保护（此生物不能被白色的东西阻挡、指定为目标、造成伤害、结附或是装备。）\\n对每个生物而言，除非其操控者为其支付{1}，否则它不能攻击你或由你操控的鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～统领\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46feaa76-feab-4dc8-946a-6fcc06826c39\', \'multiverseId\': 475386}, \'multiverseid\': 475386}, {\'name\': \'赦免統領\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n反白保護（此生物不能被白色的東西阻擋、指定為目標、造成傷害、結附或是裝備。）\\n對每個生物而言，除非其操控者為其支付{1}，否則它不能攻擊你或由你操控的鵬洛客。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～統領\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a94521e-5755-49e3-8dbb-6047b8fd3719\', \'multiverseId\': 475655}, \'multiverseid\': 475655}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ardenthal-Paladin\', \'text\': \'Adamant — Falls drei oder mehr weiße Mana ausgegeben wurden, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, kommt der Ardenthal-Paladin mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Und ist die Hoffnung nur noch das kleinste Flämmchen, das gegen die Nacht ankämpft: Ich diene dem abwesenden König."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473235&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cf764bc-3195-43ea-baea-6bc405aaca82\', \'multiverseId\': 473235}, \'multiverseid\': 473235}, {\'name\': \'Paladín del Valle de Arden\', \'text\': \'Tesón — Si se usaron al menos tres manás blancos para lanzar este hechizo, la Paladín del Valle de Arden entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Aun cuando la esperanza no es más que un candil que titila en la noche, seguiré sirviendo al rey ausente".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'261cc799-4050-4794-919d-78d9314ef625\', \'multiverseId\': 473504}, \'multiverseid\': 473504}, {\'name\': "Paladine d\'Ardenval", \'text\': "Inflexible — Si au moins trois manas blancs ont été dépensés pour lancer ce sort, la Paladine d\'Ardenval arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Même lorsque l\'espoir ne sera plus qu\'une faible lueur dans la nuit, je continuerai à servir le roi en son absence. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473773&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88543156-6563-4ab6-9a1c-6df3d55fc274\', \'multiverseId\': 473773}, \'multiverseid\': 473773}, {\'name\': \'Paladina di Ardenvalle\', \'text\': \'Adamantino — Se sono stati spesi almeno tre mana bianchi per lanciare questa magia, la Paladina di Ardenvalle entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Anche quando la speranza non sarà che una flebile fiammella sola contro la notte, servirò il re scomparso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a56bb4ec-5e93-4802-afee-a4adaeb50fa8\', \'multiverseId\': 474042}, \'multiverseid\': 474042}, {\'name\': \'アーデンベイルの聖騎士\', \'text\': \'一徹 ― この呪文を唱えるために白マナが３点以上支払われていたなら、アーデンベイルの聖騎士は＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「たとえ希望が夜に抗うかすかな炎一つだけになろうとも、私は王の不在を守る。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f94e98c-98dd-4313-b48d-cbe98190c8c3\', \'multiverseId\': 474311}, \'multiverseid\': 474311}, {\'name\': \'아르덴베일 성기사\', \'text\': \'단호 — 이 주문을 발동하는 데 적어도 백색 마나 세 개가 지불되었다면, 아르덴베일 성기사는 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': \'"희망이 캄캄한 밤을 밝히려 애쓰는 작은 불길이라고 해도, 나는 자리를 비우신 왕을 따르리라."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'570319b6-1a3f-4cef-9756-e51078549f77\', \'multiverseId\': 474580}, \'multiverseid\': 474580}, {\'name\': \'Paladina do Vale Arden\', \'text\': \'Obstinação — Se ao menos três manas brancos tiverem sido gastos para conjurar esta mágica, Paladina do Vale Arden entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Mesmo quando a esperança não passar de uma flâmula arrostando a noite, eu servirei ao rei ausente."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b60abbd2-f307-49e5-925d-174be309b8c2\', \'multiverseId\': 474849}, \'multiverseid\': 474849}, {\'name\': \'Паладин Арденвейла\', \'text\': \'Твердость — Если на разыгрывание этого заклинания было потрачено три или больше белой маны, то Паладин Арденвейла выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'«Даже если от надежды останется лишь крохотный огонек, едва мерцающий в ночи, я буду служить пропавшему королю».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d840652-ccb3-4a7a-aa39-8ffe284731c9\', \'multiverseId\': 475118}, \'multiverseid\': 475118}, {\'name\': \'雅登瓦神圣武士\', \'text\': \'固色～如果施放此咒语时支付过至少三点白色法术力，则雅登瓦神圣武士进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「纵使希望如暗夜中孤焰飘摇，我也会继续效忠失踪国君。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'522a06a4-ef99-4b08-b289-b635fbd6e119\', \'multiverseId\': 475387}, \'multiverseid\': 475387}, {\'name\': \'雅登瓦神聖武士\', \'text\': \'固色～如果施放此咒語時支付過至少三點白色魔法力，則雅登瓦神聖武士進戰場時上面有一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「縱使希望如暗夜中孤焰飄搖，我也會繼續效忠失蹤國君。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74470aba-bd69-470f-a12f-4fe78bbf4294\', \'multiverseId\': 475656}, \'multiverseid\': 475656}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ardenthal-Taktikerin // Sturzflug\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'In einem Schloss, in dem Loyalität über allem steht, ist die Verbindung zwischen Ritter und Greif unerreicht.\', \'faceName\': \'Ardenthal-Taktikerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473236&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9145cffa-766b-4cd8-aafd-53c8f350261a\', \'multiverseId\': 473236}, \'multiverseid\': 473236}, {\'name\': \'Estratega del Valle de Arden // Picado aturdidor\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'En un castillo que valora la lealtad por encima de todo, el vínculo entre el caballero y su grifo no tiene rival.\', \'faceName\': \'Estratega del Valle de Arden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'022fc07b-8f9c-4bf4-8ac0-b41320c34db6\', \'multiverseId\': 473505}, \'multiverseid\': 473505}, {\'name\': "Tacticienne d\'Ardenval // Voltige vertigineuse", \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': \'Dans un château où la loyauté prime sur tout le reste, la relation qui unit un chevalier et un griffon est inégalée.\', \'faceName\': "Tacticienne d\'Ardenval", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473774&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cce9f448-6429-4d2e-ab58-cde99a4d1dbe\', \'multiverseId\': 473774}, \'multiverseid\': 473774}, {\'name\': \'Stratega di Ardenvalle // Picchiata Vertiginosa\', \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'In un castello che pone la lealtà al di sopra di ogni cosa, il legame tra cavaliere e grifone è ineguagliabile.\', \'faceName\': \'Stratega di Ardenvalle\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e444473-7528-48d9-afa8-1f5038261e8c\', \'multiverseId\': 474043}, \'multiverseid\': 474043}, {\'name\': \'アーデンベイルの戦術家 // 眩惑する急襲\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'忠誠を何より尊ぶこの城でも、騎士とグリフィンの絆は傑出している。\', \'faceName\': \'アーデンベイルの戦術家\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51753d2d-8ae3-4fa8-a957-5dd07765beee\', \'multiverseId\': 474312}, \'multiverseid\': 474312}, {\'name\': \'아르덴베일 책략가 // 아찔한 급강하\', \'text\': \'비행\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': \'충성심을 그 무엇보다도 귀하게 여기는 성에서, 기사와 그리핀 사이의 유대는 그 누구도 따라갈 수 없다.\', \'faceName\': \'아르덴베일 책략가\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff427571-32a4-4cc5-a411-8bb8959bead4\', \'multiverseId\': 474581}, \'multiverseid\': 474581}, {\'name\': \'Tática do Vale Arden // Mergulho Vertiginoso\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'Em um castelo que valoriza a lealdade acima de tudo, o elo entre cavaleiro e grifo é inigualável.\', \'faceName\': \'Tática do Vale Arden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ef2f38d-35ba-4862-bc9b-ac79b191111d\', \'multiverseId\': 474850}, \'multiverseid\': 474850}, {\'name\': \'Тактик Арденвейла // Крутое Пике\', \'text\': \'Полет\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'В замке, где верность ценится превыше всего, ничто не сравнится с узами между рыцарем и грифоном.\', \'faceName\': \'Тактик Арденвейла\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3fa083b-8ac4-46b2-b6f4-53c8ec4c3b43\', \'multiverseId\': 475119}, \'multiverseid\': 475119}, {\'name\': \'雅登瓦策士 // 眩目天降\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'在这座推崇忠诚胜过一切的城堡之中，没有什么能比过骑士与狮鹫之间的深厚羁绊。\', \'faceName\': \'雅登瓦策士\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88bf68e9-79cc-4ee5-83b6-57fc880b7fb1\', \'multiverseId\': 475388}, \'multiverseid\': 475388}, {\'name\': \'雅登瓦策士 // 眩目天降\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': \'在這座推崇忠誠勝過一切的城堡之中，沒有什麼能比過騎士與獅鷲之間的深厚羈絆。\', \'faceName\': \'雅登瓦策士\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49011756-558f-4236-8e93-aa9be67459c8\', \'multiverseId\': 475657}, \'multiverseid\': 475657}]', '[{\'name\': \'Augensammler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Augensammler einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, legt jeder Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Fürst Rankel wird dich jetzt empfangen — er bittet dich lediglich um einen kleinen, symbolischen Tribut."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473317&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'373cb29d-de88-4373-8ebb-ebc126420376\', \'multiverseId\': 473317}, \'multiverseid\': 473317}, {\'name\': \'Coleccionista de ojos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Coleccionista de ojos haga daño de combate a un jugador, cada jugador pone la primera carta de su biblioteca en su cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hada\', \'flavor\': \'"Lord Rankle te recibirá enseguida. Todo lo que exige antes es un pequeño tributo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87525fae-ecce-4edf-9401-e57229e81a67\', \'multiverseId\': 473586}, \'multiverseid\': 473586}, {\'name\': "Collectionneur d\'yeux", \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Collectionneur d\'yeux inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, chaque joueur met la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée\', \'flavor\': "« Le seigneur Turlupin va vous recevoir... Il ne demande qu\'un petit gage de reconnaissance. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473855&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d03165eb-1ee7-4ee9-9453-57b34eb06a6b\', \'multiverseId\': 473855}, \'multiverseid\': 473855}, {\'name\': \'Collezionista di Occhi\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Collezionista di Occhi infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, ogni giocatore mette la prima carta del proprio grimorio nel proprio cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'"Lord Rankle ti riceverà a breve... In cambio chiede solo un piccolo tributo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb082804-cb99-4340-92e5-eff8e1a35296\', \'multiverseId\': 474124}, \'multiverseid\': 474124}, {\'name\': \'目玉収集家\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n目玉収集家がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを自分の墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ランクル王がお会いになられる。王が望むのはちょっとした捧げ物だけだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55bbbcbf-e87f-4f6a-a4e4-eb003cb69466\', \'multiverseId\': 474393}, \'multiverseid\': 474393}, {\'name\': \'눈 수집가\', \'text\': \'비행\\n눈 수집가가 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 각 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 페어리\', \'flavor\': \'"랭클 주인님이 이제 만나 주실 거야—소소한 공물 토큰만 바치면 돼."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f248c990-50e4-4946-b423-bbbea0599450\', \'multiverseId\': 474662}, \'multiverseid\': 474662}, {\'name\': \'Colecionador de Olhos\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Colecionador de Olhos causa dano de combate a um jogador, cada jogador coloca o card do topo do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada\', \'flavor\': \'"O senhor Rankle verá você agora... ele pede apenas um pequeno tributo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77856c1d-9f30-4e90-8a4c-740043380d74\', \'multiverseId\': 474931}, \'multiverseid\': 474931}, {\'name\': \'Коллекционер Глаз\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Коллекционер Глаз наносит боевые повреждения игроку, каждый игрок кладет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Фея\', \'flavor\': \'«Господин Ранкел готов принять тебя — но придется преподнести ему кое-что в знак признательности».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1adb8442-9285-4e28-a0e8-406c66d558ab\', \'multiverseId\': 475200}, \'multiverseid\': 475200}, {\'name\': \'集眼仙灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当集眼仙灵对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，每位牌手各将其牌库顶牌置入其坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵\', \'flavor\': \'「兰卡大人现在肯见你了～他只要你献出一份小礼。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7da5110b-8365-4c66-88ac-a6eaabd65ebb\', \'multiverseId\': 475469}, \'multiverseid\': 475469}, {\'name\': \'集眼仙靈\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當集眼仙靈對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，每位玩家各將其牌庫頂牌置入其墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙靈\', \'flavor\': \'「蘭卡大人現在肯見你了～他只要你獻出一份小禮。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'353cde3e-4945-4c28-ba9c-cb0d230e3644\', \'multiverseId\': 475738}, \'multiverseid\': 475738}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ayara, Herrscherin von Locthwain\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Ayara, Herrscherin von Locthwain, oder eine andere schwarze Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}, opfere eine andere schwarze Kreatur: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'Trauer geht nahtlos ins Feiern über, wenn sie ihren nächsten Freier wählt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473306&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76a2c9d2-f9f4-492e-b7ad-3904d62b06df\', \'multiverseId\': 473306}, \'multiverseid\': 473306}, {\'name\': \'Ayara, la Primera de Nimboscuro\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Ayara, la Primera de Nimboscuro u otra criatura negra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}, sacrificar otra criatura negra: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble elfo\', \'flavor\': \'El luto se torna en celebración en cuanto elige a su próximo pretendiente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13f548e6-484d-4aca-9aff-33e5d00d2a04\', \'multiverseId\': 473575}, \'multiverseid\': 473575}, {\'name\': \'Ayara, Première de Locthwain\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'Ayara, Première de Locthwain ou qu\'une autre créature noire arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T}, sacrifiez une autre créature noire : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': "Le deuil évolue en célébration lorsqu\'elle désigne son prétendant suivant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473844&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'661bde90-d1f6-471b-9855-0b8e0bc68c12\', \'multiverseId\': 473844}, \'multiverseid\': 473844}, {\'name\': \'Ayara, Prima di Loctevenna\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta Ayara, Prima di Loctevenna o un\'altra creatura nera entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura nera: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Il cordoglio si tramuta prontamente in esultanza quando sceglie il suo pretendente successivo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e896bf8-9df1-4d2e-9ff2-24a33dd94d57\', \'multiverseId\': 474113}, \'multiverseid\': 474113}, {\'name\': \'ロークスワインの元首、アヤーラ\', \'text\': \'ロークスワインの元首、アヤーラか他の黒のクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}, 他の黒のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'彼女が次の求婚者を選ぶと、哀悼はすぐに祝福へと変わった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99b0b4db-3f63-47f4-88b4-19664034ff72\', \'multiverseId\': 474382}, \'multiverseid\': 474382}, {\'name\': \'로크트웨인의 일인자, 아야라\', \'text\': \'로크트웨인의 일인자, 아야라 또는 다른 흑색 생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\\n{T}, 다른 흑색 생물 한 개를 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 엘프 귀족\', \'flavor\': \'그녀가 다음 구혼자를 선택하자 슬픔은 곧바로 축제로 변했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8114b5dd-4fe8-43f4-85c4-c5efb5b90f43\', \'multiverseId\': 474651}, \'multiverseid\': 474651}, {\'name\': \'Ayara, Primeira de Locthwain\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Ayara, Primeira de Locthwain, ou outra criatura preta entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}, sacrifique outra criatura preta: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'O luto passa fluidamente à celebração quando ela escolhe o próximo pretendente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8da0a161-4a53-4161-9919-46450573bedf\', \'multiverseId\': 474920}, \'multiverseid\': 474920}, {\'name\': \'Айара, Первая в Локтвейне\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Айара, Первая в Локтвейне или другое черное существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\\n{T}, пожертвуйте другое черное существо: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эльф Аристократ\', \'flavor\': \'Траур плавно перетекает в празднество, когда она выбирает нового жениха.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef759b21-0c2e-48f3-ae9a-b81116b7c027\', \'multiverseId\': 475189}, \'multiverseid\': 475189}, {\'name\': \'洛司温首领阿娅拉\', \'text\': \'每当洛司温首领阿娅拉或另一个黑色生物在你的操控下进战场时，每位对手各失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\\n{T}，牺牲另一个黑色生物：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'随着她选定继任准夫婿，原本的丧事就直接变成了喜事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'476eb4ff-1288-488c-8085-930fa3ab4367\', \'multiverseId\': 475458}, \'multiverseid\': 475458}, {\'name\': \'洛司溫首領阿婭拉\', \'text\': \'每當洛司溫首領阿婭拉或另一個黑色生物在你的操控下進戰場時，每位對手各失去1點生命且你獲得1點生命。\\n{T}，犧牲另一個黑色生物：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～妖精／貴族\', \'flavor\': \'隨著她選定繼任準夫婿，原本的喪事就直接變成了喜事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1d7be84-7d57-4880-bd48-95bfcaa698ca\', \'multiverseId\': 475727}, \'multiverseid\': 475727}]', '[{\'name\': \'Backe, backe Kuchen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine geheime Zutat? Werde ich dir nicht verraten. Nur so viel sei gesagt: Es ist nicht Liebe."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473307&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'753cf326-c728-4364-9938-dd35fdb81a99\', \'multiverseId\': 473307}, \'multiverseid\': 473307}, {\'name\': \'Convertir en tarta\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo. Crea una ficha de Comida. (Es un artefacto con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Que cuál es mi ingrediente secreto? Eso no te lo puedo decir, pero te daré una pista: no es el amor".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c4820e7-4cbd-43f6-a8fe-2c530384652d\', \'multiverseId\': 473576}, \'multiverseid\': 473576}, {\'name\': \'Faire cuire une tourte\', \'text\': "Détruisez la créature ciblée. Créez un jeton Nourriture. (C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« L\'ingrédient secret ? Eh bien, je ne peux pas vous le dire. Mais voici un indice. Ce n\'est pas l\'amour. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473845&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e2c752f-4ec4-4356-aa42-ca3698e2d97e\', \'multiverseId\': 473845}, \'multiverseid\': 473845}, {\'name\': \'Cuocere in una Torta\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Crea una pedina Cibo. (È un artefatto con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mio ingrediente segreto? Beh, non posso rivelartelo. Ma posso darti un indizio: non è l\\\'amore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'378be7f6-d663-4d72-a6eb-4ea2155a3a7a\', \'multiverseId\': 474114}, \'multiverseid\': 474114}, {\'name\': \'パイ包み\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。食物・トークンを１つ生成する。（それは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「隠し味？それは教えられないね。でもヒントをあげよう。愛情じゃあない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'920e75b3-86c0-4288-837a-cf5a1b16ecdb\', \'multiverseId\': 474383}, \'multiverseid\': 474383}, {\'name\': \'파이로 굽기\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다. 음식 토큰 한 개를 만든다. (음식 토큰은 "{2}, {T}, 이 마법물체를 희생한다: 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다."를 가진 마법물체이다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"내 비밀 재료 말이야? 그건 알려줄 수 없지. 하지만 힌트는 줄게. 사랑은 아니야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e38f9226-9a20-4b04-934b-cbaeda9b03d6\', \'multiverseId\': 474652}, \'multiverseid\': 474652}, {\'name\': \'Enfornar na Torta\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo. Crie uma ficha de Comida. (Ela é um artefato com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida.")\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Meu ingrediente secreto? Bom, não posso contar. Mas eis uma dica: Não é amor."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'379c917d-06e5-402a-b970-1d8945f09dd3\', \'multiverseId\': 474921}, \'multiverseid\': 474921}, {\'name\': \'Запечь в Пироге\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо. Создайте одну фишку Еды. (Она является артефактом со способностью «{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: вы получаете 3 жизни».)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Мой секретный ингредиент? Ну, этого я тебе сказать не могу. Но могу намекнуть, что это не любовь».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d48e3b0-b88d-4417-8932-e64a5bf2ed54\', \'multiverseId\': 475190}, \'multiverseid\': 475190}, {\'name\': \'纳饼入炉\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。派出一个食品衍生物。（食品衍生物是具有「{2}，{T}，牺牲此神器：你获得3点生命」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我的秘密配方？这我可不能告诉你。不过可以稍微提示一下。反正不是爱。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fee1b01-d4c0-4c29-9469-41af35583b1a\', \'multiverseId\': 475459}, \'multiverseid\': 475459}, {\'name\': \'納餅入爐\', \'text\': \'消滅目標生物。派出一個食品衍生物。（食品衍生物是具有「{2}，{T}，犧牲此神器：你獲得3點生命」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我的秘密配方？這我可不能告訴你。不過可以稍微提示一下。反正不是愛。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'104e7e9b-35d7-4f18-a539-b3868f4d4d2a\', \'multiverseId\': 475728}, \'multiverseid\': 475728}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bejubelte Wettstreiterin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Bejubelte Wettstreiterin ins Spiel kommt und falls du einen anderen Ritter kontrollierst, schaue dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Ritter-, Aura-, Ausrüstungs- oder legendäre Artefaktkarte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473232&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cbf9a94-8d6c-47cd-b660-be6faf51f4c8\', \'multiverseId\': 473232}, \'multiverseid\': 473232}, {\'name\': \'Contendiente aclamada\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Contendiente aclamada entre al campo de batalla, si controlas otro Caballero, mira las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de Caballero, Aura, Equipo o artefacto legendario que se encuentre entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d670142b-30d4-44fb-ba3a-997e69399e70\', \'multiverseId\': 473501}, \'multiverseid\': 473501}, {\'name\': \'Concurrente acclamée\', \'text\': "Quand la Concurrente acclamée arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous contrôlez un autre chevalier, regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte de chevalier, d\'aura, d\'équipement ou d\'artefact légendaire parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473770&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6cfa25b-8df4-4e84-851c-1f3e1bb3f5e7\', \'multiverseId\': 473770}, \'multiverseid\': 473770}, {\'name\': \'Contendente Acclamata\', \'text\': \'Quando la Contendente Acclamata entra nel campo di battaglia, se controlli un altro Cavaliere, guarda le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta Cavaliere, Aura, Equipaggiamento o artefatto leggendario scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17b55762-63df-4af8-ae3e-ed274a10f4d1\', \'multiverseId\': 474039}, \'multiverseid\': 474039}, {\'name\': \'評判高い挑戦者\', \'text\': \'評判高い挑戦者が戦場に出たとき、あなたが他の騎士をコントロールしている場合、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚見る。あなたはその中から、騎士かオーラか装備品か伝説のアーティファクトであるカード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23da06f1-18af-45c7-a7bd-da3b2c94abf8\', \'multiverseId\': 474308}, \'multiverseid\': 474308}, {\'name\': \'칭송받는 경쟁자\', \'text\': \'칭송받는 경쟁자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 다른 기사를 조종한다면, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 다섯 장을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 기사, 마법진, 장비 또는 전설적 마법물체 카드 한 장을 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 무작위 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7d376d7-1090-44ed-ad91-47d6cf9bbb53\', \'multiverseId\': 474577}, \'multiverseid\': 474577}, {\'name\': \'Competidora Aclamada\', \'text\': \'Quando Competidora Aclamada entrar no campo de batalha, se você controlar outro Cavaleiro, olhe os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de Cavaleiro, Aura, Equipamento ou artefato lendário dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4561c6f6-734e-4b81-9bd7-80485c7bfa73\', \'multiverseId\': 474846}, \'multiverseid\': 474846}, {\'name\': \'Превозносимая Претендентка\', \'text\': \'Когда Превозносимая Претендентка выходит на поле битвы, если вы контролируете другого Рыцаря, посмотрите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них карту Рыцаря, Ауры, Снаряжения или легендарного артефакта и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f7ee94d-a796-4413-ac2d-333575174831\', \'multiverseId\': 475115}, \'multiverseid\': 475115}, {\'name\': \'受誉竞争者\', \'text\': \'当受誉竞争者进战场时，若你操控另一个骑士，则检视你牌库顶的五张牌。你可以展示其中的一张骑士、灵气、武具或传奇神器牌，并将它置于你手上。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1b3bc5f-fbc7-49fc-a3cc-39099fabc0ad\', \'multiverseId\': 475384}, \'multiverseid\': 475384}, {\'name\': \'受譽競爭者\', \'text\': \'當受譽競爭者進戰場時，若你操控另一個騎士，則檢視你牌庫頂的五張牌。你可以展示其中的一張騎士、靈氣、武具或傳奇神器牌，並將它置於你手上。將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bc6fabe-ea2c-4f81-8f0d-e95d13087bfe\', \'multiverseId\': 475653}, \'multiverseid\': 475653}]', '[{\'name\': \'Besen des Hexenmeisters\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine andere bleibende Karte opferst, kannst du {3} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie des Besens des Hexenmeisters ist.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Reynald wünschte sich eine Armee, um seine Feinde hinwegzufegen. Der Feenkönig lächelte."\\n—*Jenseits des Großen Steinkreises*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473463&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8f8113d-bc7b-4fbe-96cd-9be6b7a0bde9\', \'multiverseId\': 473463}, \'multiverseid\': 473463}, {\'name\': \'Escobas del brujo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que sacrifiques otro permanente, puedes pagar {3}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha que es una copia de las Escobas del brujo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"Reynald deseaba un ejército con el que barrer a sus enemigos. El rey de las hadas sonrió".\\n—*Más allá del Gran Crómlech*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08ef60c3-0ab3-4360-8a5f-e18a2f613722\', \'multiverseId\': 473732}, \'multiverseid\': 473732}, {\'name\': \'Balai de sorcier\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous sacrifiez un autre permanent, vous pouvez payer {3}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton qui est une copie du Balai de sorcier.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'« Reynald souhaita avoir une armée capable de balayer ses ennemis. Le roi des fæs esquissa un sourire. »\\n—*Au-delà du Grand Cromlech*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474001&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08a4a042-fcce-44f3-83c8-e3f8bf02bccd\', \'multiverseId\': 474001}, \'multiverseid\': 474001}, {\'name\': \'Scopa dello Stregone\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta sacrifichi un altro permanente, puoi pagare {3}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina che è una copia della Scopa dello Stregone.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Reynald desiderò un esercito con cui spazzare via i suoi nemici. Il re delle fate sorrise."\\n—*Oltre il Grande Monolito*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d167d917-4d2d-42a6-a73d-3ca8c60a6617\', \'multiverseId\': 474270}, \'multiverseid\': 474270}, {\'name\': \'呪術師のほうき\', \'text\': \'あなたが他のパーマネントを１つ生け贄に捧げるたび、あなたは{3}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、呪術師のほうきのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「レイナルドは敵を一掃する軍隊が欲しいと言った。フェイの王は笑みを浮かべた。」\\n――*グレートヘンジを超えて*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'959a029b-298e-4905-a580-0f54644d6051\', \'multiverseId\': 474539}, \'multiverseid\': 474539}, {\'name\': \'마법사의 빗자루\', \'text\': \'당신이 다른 지속물을 희생할 때마다, 당신은 {3}을 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 마법사의 빗자루의 복사본인 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': \'"레이날드는 그의 적들을 쓸어 없앨 수 있는 군대를 바랬다. 요정 왕은 미소지었다."\\n—*거대한 헨지 저편*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a076c7ed-4d9e-4bbb-abae-41c7e267edf8\', \'multiverseId\': 474808}, \'multiverseid\': 474808}, {\'name\': \'Vassoura do Feiticeiro\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que sacrifica outra permanente, você pode pagar {3}. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia de Vassoura do Feiticeiro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'"Reynald desejava um exército para varrer seus inimigos. O rei das fadinas sorriu."\\n— *Além do Grande Círculo*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'571c8f97-09ae-4b67-a609-4106d3034825\', \'multiverseId\': 475077}, \'multiverseid\': 475077}, {\'name\': \'Метла Колдуна\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы жертвуете другой перманент, вы можете заплатить {3}. Если вы это делаете, создайте одну фишку, являющуюся копией Метлы Колдуна.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'«Рейнальд пожелал получить армию, которая сметет его врагов. Король фей улыбнулся».\\n— *«За Великим Кромлехом»*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca5c6244-9c9a-4421-845d-7f079fe2fddd\', \'multiverseId\': 475346}, \'multiverseid\': 475346}, {\'name\': \'术士扫帚\', \'text\': \'每当你牺牲另一个永久物时，你可以支付{3}。若你如此作，则派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为术士扫帚的复制品。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「雷纳德许愿要一支军队，好帮他扫清敌人。仙儿国王微微一笑。」\\n～*《圆石阵奇谭》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc20c2cb-1a1d-485b-bce5-af66e0196f9f\', \'multiverseId\': 475615}, \'multiverseid\': 475615}, {\'name\': \'術士掃帚\', \'text\': \'每當你犧牲另一個永久物時，你可以支付{3}。若你如此作，則派出一個衍生物，此衍生物為術士掃帚的複製品。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'「雷納德許願要一支軍隊，好幫他掃清敵人。仙兒國王微微一笑。」\\n～*《圓石陣奇譚》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b755ac8e-a15d-4b43-a58d-7589511da83b\', \'multiverseId\': 475884}, \'multiverseid\': 475884}]', '[{\'name\': \'Besitzergreifender Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Besitzergreifende Drache ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Menschen oder ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, den bzw. das ein Gegner kontrolliert. Solange der Besitzergreifende Drache im Spiel ist, kontrollierst du die bestimmte bleibende Karte. Sie verliert alle Fähigkeiten und kann nicht angreifen oder blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473364&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa23d2b1-9626-4f55-9922-472269e228b0\', \'multiverseId\': 473364}, \'multiverseid\': 473364}, {\'name\': \'Dragona oportunista\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Dragona oportunista entre al campo de batalla, elige un Humano o artefacto objetivo que controla un oponente. Mientras la Dragona oportunista permanezca en el campo de batalla, gana el control de ese permanente. Pierde todas las habilidades y no puede atacar ni bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3248778e-bc59-44d1-8801-42292299a2d6\', \'multiverseId\': 473633}, \'multiverseid\': 473633}, {\'name\': \'Dragon opportuniste\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Dragon opportuniste arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un humain ciblé ou un artefact ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Tant que le Dragon opportuniste reste sur le champ de bataille, acquérez le contrôle de ce permanent, il perd toutes ses capacités et il ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473902&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c130219c-34ee-4b30-a830-b832ef2427eb\', \'multiverseId\': 473902}, \'multiverseid\': 473902}, {\'name\': \'Drago Opportunista\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Drago Opportunista entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un Umano o un artefatto bersaglio controllato da un avversario. Fintanto che il Drago Opportunista rimane sul campo di battaglia, prendi il controllo di quel permanente, che perde tutte le sue abilità e non può attaccare o bloccare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7752935b-0177-4ed0-b9b2-20e5e8dfc3b5\', \'multiverseId\': 474171}, \'multiverseid\': 474171}, {\'name\': \'日和見ドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n日和見ドラゴンが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしている、人間１体かアーティファクト１つを対象とする。日和見ドラゴンが戦場に残り続けているかぎり、あなたはそのパーマネントのコントロールを得て、それはすべての能力を失い、それでは攻撃もブロックもできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13465a90-3994-4268-9266-cab82910bc7e\', \'multiverseId\': 474440}, \'multiverseid\': 474440}, {\'name\': \'기회주의적인 용\', \'text\': \'비행\\n기회주의적인 용이 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 인간 또는 마법물체를 목표로 정한다. 기회주의적인 용이 전장에 남아 있는 한, 그 지속물의 조종권을 얻고, 그 지속물은 모든 능력을 잃으며, 그 지속물은 공격하거나 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02a11c22-c4c0-4024-b775-26354337f2fd\', \'multiverseId\': 474709}, \'multiverseid\': 474709}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Oportunista\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Dragão Oportunista entrar no campo de batalha, escolha o Humano ou artefato alvo que um oponente controla. Enquanto Dragão Oportunista permanecer no campo de batalha, ganhe o controle daquela permanente. Ela perde todas as habilidades e não pode atacar nem bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58783d30-3f18-4501-9ae4-54ae7648b693\', \'multiverseId\': 474978}, \'multiverseid\': 474978}, {\'name\': \'Меркантильный Дракон\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Меркантильный Дракон выходит на поле битвы, выберите целевого Человека или артефакт под контролем оппонента. До тех пор, пока Меркантильный Дракон остается на поле битвы, получите контроль над тем перманентом, он теряет все способности и не может атаковать и блокировать.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d57d2b6-31a4-4e7a-8dfa-ea5aba10c1d6\', \'multiverseId\': 475247}, \'multiverseid\': 475247}, {\'name\': \'守成巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当守成巨龙进战场时，选择目标由对手操控的人类或神器。对该永久物而言，于守成巨龙仍在战场上的时段内，你获得它的操控权、它失去所有异能且它不能进行攻击或阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02e9e3f1-d02f-4145-9087-bd7199b085f8\', \'multiverseId\': 475516}, \'multiverseid\': 475516}, {\'name\': \'守成巨龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當守成巨龍進戰場時，選擇目標由對手操控的人類或神器。對該永久物而言，於守成巨龍仍在戰場上的時段內，你獲得它的操控權、它失去所有異能且它不能進行攻擊或阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2615f6d5-037f-4fa6-9058-a4ea669c7014\', \'multiverseId\': 475785}, \'multiverseid\': 475785}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bestehler der Reichen\', \'text\': \'Reichweite, Eile\\nImmer wenn der Bestehler der Reichen angreift und falls der verteidigende Spieler mehr Karten auf der Hand hat als du, schicke die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Während eines beliebigen Zuges, in dem du einen Räuber als Angreifer deklariert hast, kannst du die Karte wirken, und um sie zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Bogenschütze, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473369&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f24630b-1aad-484e-a567-128f16ddeadf\', \'multiverseId\': 473369}, \'multiverseid\': 473369}, {\'name\': \'Ladrón de los ricos\', \'text\': \'Alcance, prisa.\\nSiempre que el Ladrón de los ricos ataque, si el jugador defensor tiene más cartas en la mano que tú, exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca. Durante cualquier turno en el que atacaste con un Bribón, puedes lanzar esa carta y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzar ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón arquero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a210add-ec8e-43b1-b175-ea4227e1f3f7\', \'multiverseId\': 473638}, \'multiverseid\': 473638}, {\'name\': \'Voleur de riches\', \'text\': "Portée, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que le Voleur de riches attaque, si le joueur défenseur a plus de cartes en main que vous, exilez la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Pendant chaque tour où vous avez attaqué avec un gredin, vous pouvez lancer cette carte et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et archer et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473907&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1f632aa-07ee-4515-a49d-1db737c09955\', \'multiverseId\': 473907}, \'multiverseid\': 473907}, {\'name\': \'Rapinatore dei Ricchi\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere, rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta il Rapinatore dei Ricchi attacca, se il giocatore in difesa ha più carte in mano di te, esilia la prima carta del suo grimorio. Durante qualsiasi turno in cui hai attaccato con un Farabutto, puoi lanciare quella carta e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per lanciare quella magia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Arciere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad099c1d-eea4-4c9b-9021-4467eacd9d85\', \'multiverseId\': 474176}, \'multiverseid\': 474176}, {\'name\': \'義賊\', \'text\': \'到達、速攻\\n義賊が攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーの手札にあるカードがあなたの手札にあるカードよりも多い場合、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。あなたがならず者で攻撃したターンの間、あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよく、あなたはその呪文を唱えるために任意のマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・射手・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'753a9761-3615-4295-ba0e-c82cb6ac75a0\', \'multiverseId\': 474445}, \'multiverseid\': 474445}, {\'name\': \'부자들의 강도\', \'text\': \'대공, 신속\\n부자들의 강도가 공격할 때마다, 수비플레이어가 손에 당신보다 많은 카드를 가지고 있다면, 그 플레이어의 서고 맨 위 카드를 추방한다. 당신이 도적으로 공격한 아무 턴에, 당신은 그 카드를 발동할 수 있고 그 카드를 발동하기 위한 마나는 당신이 원하는 색의 마나인 것처럼 사용할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 궁수 도적\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62a7d742-2ba3-4ece-a8a4-e735d03eced0\', \'multiverseId\': 474714}, \'multiverseid\': 474714}, {\'name\': \'Ladrão dos Ricos\', \'text\': \'Alcance, ímpeto\\nToda vez que Ladrão dos Ricos atacar, se o jogador defensor tiver mais cards na mão que você, exile o card do topo do grimório dele. Durante qualquer turno em que você tiver atacado com um Ladino, você pode conjurar aquele card e pode gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer cor para conjurar aquela mágica.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Arqueiro Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'566d0e44-0576-4206-ab57-738997729f8b\', \'multiverseId\': 474983}, \'multiverseid\': 474983}, {\'name\': \'Грабитель Богачей\', \'text\': \'Захват, Ускорение\\nКаждый раз, когда Грабитель Богачей атакует, если у защищающегося игрока больше карт в руке, чем у вас, изгоните верхнюю карту его библиотеки. В любом ходу, в котором вы атаковали Бродягой, вы можете разыграть ту карту, если это заклинание, и вы можете тратить ману на разыгрывание того заклинания, как если бы это была мана любого цвета.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Лучник Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9af58ec5-1fb1-4905-8371-d803afc65828\', \'multiverseId\': 475252}, \'multiverseid\': 475252}, {\'name\': \'劫富侠客\', \'text\': \'延势，敏捷\\n每当劫富侠客攻击时，若防御牌手的手牌数量比你多，则放逐防御牌手的牌库顶牌。于你以浪客攻击过的回合中，你可以施放该牌，且你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来支付施放该咒语的费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／弓箭手／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92b3056e-720c-4929-b14a-8a9ca8f822a0\', \'multiverseId\': 475521}, \'multiverseid\': 475521}, {\'name\': \'劫富俠客\', \'text\': \'延勢，敏捷\\n每當劫富俠客攻擊時，若防禦玩家的手牌數量比你多，則放逐防禦玩家的牌庫頂牌。於你以浪客攻擊過的回合中，你可以施放該牌，且你可以將魔法力視同任意顏色的魔法力來支付施放該咒語的費用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／弓箭手／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60457edc-01dc-4fd3-93d8-1360c0ba4cad\', \'multiverseId\': 475790}, \'multiverseid\': 475790}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bezaubernder Prinz\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Bezaubernde Prinz ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Hellsicht 2.\\n• Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n• Schicke eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du besitzt, ins Exil. Bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473239&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f52887a-c392-42cd-b26a-2ffa9a71291d\', \'multiverseId\': 473239}, \'multiverseid\': 473239}, {\'name\': \'Príncipe encantador\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Príncipe encantador entre al campo de batalla, elige uno:\\n• Adivina 2.\\n• Ganas 3 vidas.\\n• Exilia otra criatura objetivo de la cual eres propietario. Regrésala al campo de batalla bajo tu control al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25891001-96a6-4ae5-a1d2-d695af112a65\', \'multiverseId\': 473508}, \'multiverseid\': 473508}, {\'name\': \'Prince charmant\', \'text\': "Quand le Prince charmant arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Regard 2.\\n• Vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\\n• Exilez une autre créature ciblée que vous possédez. Renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473777&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ae85171-540c-4264-9f41-3130032043b4\', \'multiverseId\': 473777}, \'multiverseid\': 473777}, {\'name\': \'Principe Affascinante\', \'text\': "Quando il Principe Affascinante entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli uno —\\n• Profetizza 2.\\n• Guadagni 3 punti vita.\\n• Esilia un\'altra creatura bersaglio che possiedi. Rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24ccf8b2-a131-49af-a53a-070a71bf8606\', \'multiverseId\': 474046}, \'multiverseid\': 474046}, {\'name\': \'魅力的な王子\', \'text\': \'魅力的な王子が戦場に出たとき、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 占術２を行う。\\n• あなたは３点のライフを得る。\\n• 他の、あなたがオーナーであるクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c04b3f5-be10-48e7-93c1-0f6259218e7f\', \'multiverseId\': 474315}, \'multiverseid\': 474315}, {\'name\': \'매력적인 왕자\', \'text\': \'매력적인 왕자가 전장에 들어올 때, 하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 점술 2를 한다.\\n• 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다.\\n• 당신이 소유한 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다. 다음 종료단 시작에, 그 생물을 당신의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 귀족\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f327655b-f621-4790-a7a0-93309d5af5ef\', \'multiverseId\': 474584}, \'multiverseid\': 474584}, {\'name\': \'Príncipe Encantado\', \'text\': \'Quando Príncipe Encantado entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um —\\n• Use vidência 2.\\n• Você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\\n• Exile outra criatura alvo que você possui. Devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob seu controle no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26d4bf76-b7a1-48b7-b24e-731c794efee7\', \'multiverseId\': 474853}, \'multiverseid\': 474853}, {\'name\': \'Прекрасный Принц\', \'text\': \'Когда Прекрасный Принц выходит на поле битвы, выберите одно —\\n• Предскажите 2.\\n• Вы получаете 3 жизни.\\n• Изгоните другое принадлежащее вам целевое существо. Верните его на поле битвы под вашим контролем в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Аристократ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b217b156-f845-4a07-9b7f-28162e5c1f18\', \'multiverseId\': 475122}, \'multiverseid\': 475122}, {\'name\': \'英俊王子\', \'text\': \'当英俊王子进战场时，选择一项～\\n•占卜2。\\n•你获得3点生命。\\n•放逐另一个目标由你拥有的生物。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它在你的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d258dcb4-e12e-4ab4-933b-18132dee3ccf\', \'multiverseId\': 475391}, \'multiverseid\': 475391}, {\'name\': \'英俊王子\', \'text\': \'當英俊王子進戰場時，選擇一項～\\n‧占卜2。\\n‧你獲得3點生命。\\n‧放逐另一個目標由你擁有的生物。在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它在你的操控下移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0754c57-6da0-4e4d-a8a8-d67ff75ab746\', \'multiverseId\': 475660}, \'multiverseid\': 475660}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutkappen-Keilerei\', \'text\': \'Der Blutkappen-Schaukampf fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls einer nichtroten bleibenden Karte auf diese Weise Schaden zugefügt wird, opfere ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Anfangs spottete Syr Fenwick, als er seine Gegner für den finalen Kampf sah.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473366&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63342c86-01f4-4d2d-b54a-23ed64496f1e\', \'multiverseId\': 473366}, \'multiverseid\': 473366}, {\'name\': \'Reyerta de los gorros rojos\', \'text\': \'La Reyerta de los gorros rojos hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo. Si un permanente que no sea rojo recibe daño de esta manera, sacrificas una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Al principio, Syr Fenwick se rio con desdén cuando vio a los que serían sus adversarios en el combate final.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d44b3433-e792-4395-8fa1-bd59ce5e09e3\', \'multiverseId\': 473635}, \'multiverseid\': 473635}, {\'name\': \'Bagarre de bonnets-rouges\', \'text\': \'La Bagarre de bonnets-rouges inflige 4 blessures à la créature ciblée ou au planeswalker ciblé. Si un permanent non-rouge subit des blessures de cette manière, vous sacrifiez un terrain.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Syr Fenwick ricana lorsqu\'il vit les autres finalistes pour la première fois.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2497781e-317d-4ddf-85f0-5ea4f04469d2\', \'multiverseId\': 473904}, \'multiverseid\': 473904}, {\'name\': \'Mischia di Berretti Rossi\', \'text\': \'La Mischia di Berretti Rossi infligge 4 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio. Se viene inflitto danno a un permanente non rosso in questo modo, sacrifica una terra.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "All\'inizio, Syr Fenwick sorrise beffardamente quando vide i suoi avversari per lo scontro finale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7ce6663-385f-41f8-abb5-169762211704\', \'multiverseId\': 474173}, \'multiverseid\': 474173}, {\'name\': \'レッドキャップの乱闘\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。レッドキャップの乱闘はそれに４点のダメージを与える。これにより赤でないパーマネントにダメージが与えられたなら、あなたは土地１つを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'決勝で相手を見たフェンウィック卿は、最初は嘲笑っていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe9d0a38-bbcc-4ceb-9096-fff90d070c48\', \'multiverseId\': 474442}, \'multiverseid\': 474442}, {\'name\': \'붉은모자 근접전\', \'text\': \'생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 붉은모자 근접전은 그 목표에게 피해 4점을 입힌다. 적색이 아닌 지속물이 이런 식으로 피해를 입었다면, 당신은 대지 한 개를 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'처음에, 펜윅 경은 결승전에 나타난 상대들을 보고 그들을 비웃었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b12de75-afc8-4b29-852f-332969e9b5f2\', \'multiverseId\': 474711}, \'multiverseid\': 474711}, {\'name\': \'Embate com Barretes Vermelhos\', \'text\': \'Embate com Barretes Vermelhos causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo. Se uma permanente que não seja vermelha sofrer dano dessa forma, você sacrifica um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A princípio, Syr Fenwick desdenhou quando viu seus oponentes na final.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'906f2a9e-93a0-473b-afa2-85548800a66a\', \'multiverseId\': 474980}, \'multiverseid\': 474980}, {\'name\': \'Драка Красных Колпаков\', \'text\': \'Драка Красных Колпаков наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу или planeswalker-у. Если таким образом наносятся повреждения не являющемуся красным перманенту, вы жертвуете землю.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Увидев своих противников в финальном матче, сейр Фенвик сперва презрительно поморщился.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5f2c3af-1d36-4810-b987-dd954b949856\', \'multiverseId\': 475249}, \'multiverseid\': 475249}, {\'name\': \'红帽客搏战\', \'text\': \'红帽客搏战对目标生物或鹏洛客造成4点伤害。如果有非红色的永久物以此法受到伤害，则你牺牲一个地。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'一开始，芬威克爵士并没有把决赛对手放在眼里。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'907235ae-e991-4c3c-9540-e5e06c63af6e\', \'multiverseId\': 475518}, \'multiverseid\': 475518}, {\'name\': \'紅帽客搏戰\', \'text\': \'紅帽客搏戰對目標生物或鵬洛客造成4點傷害。如果有非紅色的永久物以此法受到傷害，則你犧牲一個地。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'一開始，芬威克爵士並沒有把決賽對手放在眼裡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90b5c318-146c-4d6e-a9ef-4eb9d93d6a71\', \'multiverseId\': 475787}, \'multiverseid\': 475787}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutkappen-Plünderer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Blutkappen-Plünderer angreifen, kannst du eine ungetappte Nicht-Mensch-Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, tappen. Falls du dies tust, erhalten die Blutkappen-Plünderer +1/+1 und verursachen Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bewundere ihren Mut genauso sehr, wie ich ihre Barbarei verabscheue."\\n—Syr Carah die Tapfere\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473367&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43c8a8ad-c707-4fdf-822c-3d799b35b9cd\', \'multiverseId\': 473367}, \'multiverseid\': 473367}, {\'name\': \'Saqueadores gorro rojo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que los Saqueadores gorro rojo ataquen, puedes girar una criatura enderezada que no sea Humano que controlas. Si lo haces, los Saqueadores gorro rojo obtienen +1/+1 y ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Admiro su coraje tanto como desprecio su brutalidad".\\n—Syr Carah, la Osada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b488f8a9-77fb-43eb-b453-a23fd51f9990\', \'multiverseId\': 473636}, \'multiverseid\': 473636}, {\'name\': \'Pillards bonnets-rouges\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que les Pillards bonnets-rouges attaquent, vous pouvez engager une créature non-Humain dégagée que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, les Pillards bonnets-rouges gagnent +1/+1 et acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« J\'admire leur courage autant que j\'exècre leur sauvagerie. »\\n—Syr Carah, l\'Audacieuse", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473905&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e201f07-2191-4c15-a530-cf720c49f541\', \'multiverseId\': 473905}, \'multiverseid\': 473905}, {\'name\': \'Berretti Rossi Predoni\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta i Berretti Rossi Predoni attaccano, puoi TAPpare una creatura non Umano STAPpata che controlli. Se lo fai, i Berretti Rossi Predoni prendono +1/+1 e hanno travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Ammiro il loro coraggio tanto quanto disprezzo la loro barbarie."\\n—Syr Carah, l\\\'Audace\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0e51567-a476-4947-abe8-00f6002d6447\', \'multiverseId\': 474174}, \'multiverseid\': 474174}, {\'name\': \'レッドキャップの略奪者\', \'text\': \'レッドキャップの略奪者が攻撃するたび、あなたはあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態で人間でないクリーチャー１体をタップしてもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、レッドキャップの略奪者は＋１/＋１の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「私は彼らの勇気を讃える。その残虐さを蔑むのと同等に。」\\n――勇敢な騎士、カラ卿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3736637-242b-4873-8c49-e6a77f9f7757\', \'multiverseId\': 474443}, \'multiverseid\': 474443}, {\'name\': \'붉은모자 약탈꾼들\', \'text\': \'붉은모자 약탈꾼들이 공격할 때마다, 당신은 당신이 조종하는 인간이 아닌 언탭된 생물 한 개를 탭할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 붉은모자 약탈꾼들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 돌진을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고블린 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"나는 그들의 야만성을 경멸하는 만큼 그들의 용감함을 추앙한다네."\\n—대담한 자, 카라 경\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0d2bae8-666f-4d31-87a2-e5f044d34027\', \'multiverseId\': 474712}, \'multiverseid\': 474712}, {\'name\': \'Salteadores Barretes Vermelhos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Salteadores Barretes Vermelhos ataca, você pode virar uma criatura que não seja do tipo Humano desvirada que você controla. Se fizer isso, Salteadores Barretes Vermelhos receberá +1/+1 e ganhará atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu admiro a coragem deles tanto quanto desprezo sua selvageria."\\n— Syr Carah, a Ousada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6213fcd6-07b3-4a4f-b7d1-501c212b98a4\', \'multiverseId\': 474981}, \'multiverseid\': 474981}, {\'name\': \'Красные Колпаки-Налетчики\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Красные Колпаки-Налетчики атакуют, вы можете повернуть неповернутое не являющееся Человеком существо под вашим контролем. Если вы это делаете, Красные Колпаки-Налетчики получают +1/+1 и Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Я восхищаюсь их смелостью столь же искренне, сколь презираю их дикарский нрав».\\n— сейра Кара, Смелая\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8972d03-3ae2-452e-bd2b-4bbe78d18047\', \'multiverseId\': 475250}, \'multiverseid\': 475250}, {\'name\': \'红帽客突击队\', \'text\': \'每当红帽客突击队攻击时，你可以横置一个由你操控且未横置的非人类生物。若你如此作，则直到回合结束，红帽客突击队得+1/+1且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我鄙夷他们的蛮野，但我欣赏他们的勇气。」\\n～勇威凯拉爵士\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c5288b0-b132-48fa-81bc-2a47c0a7d96d\', \'multiverseId\': 475519}, \'multiverseid\': 475519}, {\'name\': \'紅帽客突擊隊\', \'text\': \'每當紅帽客突擊隊攻擊時，你可以橫置一個由你操控且未橫置的非人類生物。若你如此作，則直到回合結束，紅帽客突擊隊得+1/+1且獲得踐踏異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「我鄙夷他們的蠻野，但我欣賞他們的勇氣。」\\n～勇威凱拉爵士\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06978095-1bdf-458a-85cc-9a3fcb619bc1\', \'multiverseId\': 475788}, \'multiverseid\': 475788}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutschleier-Vielfraß\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erhält der Blutschleier-Vielfraß +1/+1 und Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vielfraß\', \'flavor\': \'„Legt einen Graben an. Wenn wir Glück haben, kann er nicht schwimmen."\\n—Syr Branigan, Ritter von Ardenthal\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473344&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45a50e93-96d4-4d70-b626-01a4726cab75\', \'multiverseId\': 473344}, \'multiverseid\': 473344}, {\'name\': \'Glotón sangrebruma\', \'text\': \'Siempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, el Glotón sangrebruma obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Glotón\', \'flavor\': \'"Construye un foso. Si tenemos suerte, no sabrá nadar".\\n—Syr Branigan, caballero del Valle de Arden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d00ced9c-c014-47fc-9f6b-1347189697ec\', \'multiverseId\': 473613}, \'multiverseid\': 473613}, {\'name\': \'Glouton fièvresang\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, le Glouton fièvresang gagne +1/+1 et acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : glouton\', \'flavor\': "« Creusez des douves. Avec un peu de chance, il ne sait pas nager. »\\n—Syr Branigan, chevalier d\'Ardenval", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473882&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6cd347d-f090-43dc-a15b-3ce5654d6b2d\', \'multiverseId\': 473882}, \'multiverseid\': 473882}, {\'name\': \'Ghiottone della Bruma Sanguinaria\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, il Ghiottone della Bruma Sanguinaria prende +1/+1 e ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ghiottone\', \'flavor\': \'"Scava un fossato. Se siamo fortunati, non sa nuotare."\\n—Syr Branigan, cavaliere di Ardenvalle\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3aa00e9d-5292-4f15-b13f-6d980fc46d94\', \'multiverseId\': 474151}, \'multiverseid\': 474151}, {\'name\': \'血霞のクズリ\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターンのあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、ターン終了時まで、血霞のクズリは＋１/＋１の修整を受け先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — クズリ\', \'flavor\': \'「掘を作れ。ひょっとしたら、あいつは泳げないかもしれない。」\\n――アーデンベイルの騎士、ブラニガン卿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57459565-b00b-4fa0-8aca-7b0c3326f84b\', \'multiverseId\': 474420}, \'multiverseid\': 474420}, {\'name\': \'피아지랑이 울버린\', \'text\': \'당신이 각 턴에 당신의 두 번째 카드를 뽑을 때마다, 피아지랑이 울버린은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 선제공격을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 울버린\', \'flavor\': \'"해자를 건설해라. 운이 좋으면, 그 놈이 수영은 못 하겠지."\\n—아르덴베일의 기사, 브라니간 경\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'984bfcfa-dc7d-4491-8968-8755300e1465\', \'multiverseId\': 474689}, \'multiverseid\': 474689}, {\'name\': \'Carcaju Sanguinévoa\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você compra seu segundo card a cada turno, Carcaju Sanguinévoa recebe +1/+1 e ganha iniciativa até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Carcaju\', \'flavor\': \'"Cave um fosso. Com sorte ele não sabe nadar."\\n— Syr Branigan, cavaleiro do Vale Arden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f936d338-c6ec-4a73-ac18-1f686b562ef9\', \'multiverseId\': 474958}, \'multiverseid\': 474958}, {\'name\': \'Росомаха Кровавой Пелены\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы берете вашу вторую карту в каждом ходу, Росомаха Кровавой Пелены получает +1/+1 и Первый удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Росомаха\', \'flavor\': \'«Выкопайте ров. Если нам повезет, она не умеет плавать».\\n— сейр Браниган, рыцарь Арденвейла\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb634b2e-d1f7-4cf1-b2d4-6c978426901f\', \'multiverseId\': 475227}, \'multiverseid\': 475227}, {\'name\': \'血迷狼獾\', \'text\': \'每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，直到回合结束，血迷狼獾得+1/+1且获得先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼獾\', \'flavor\': \'「建条护城河。如果运气好的话，它游不了泳。」\\n～雅登瓦骑士，巴尼根爵士\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'081f12ec-0e39-4a38-a942-a5ee870485eb\', \'multiverseId\': 475496}, \'multiverseid\': 475496}, {\'name\': \'血迷狼獾\', \'text\': \'每當你抽每回合中你的第二張牌時，直到回合結束，血迷狼獾得+1/+1且獲得先攻異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼獾\', \'flavor\': \'「建條護城河。如果運氣好的話，牠游不了泳。」\\n～雅登瓦騎士，巴尼根爵士\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'532da07f-6a75-46b1-8ef7-8f21f5a6a16c\', \'multiverseId\': 475765}, \'multiverseid\': 475765}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bratspieß des Riesen\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+1.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur einer Kreatur Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\\nAusrüsten {3} ({3}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473322&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3fa539c-da22-43f9-b3e0-fe875cf04127\', \'multiverseId\': 473322}, \'multiverseid\': 473322}, {\'name\': \'Brocheta de gigante\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+1.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate a una criatura, crea una ficha de Comida. (Es un artefacto con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\\nEquipar {3}. ({3}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5589e521-f5a3-4b58-9759-e66833b93b87\', \'multiverseId\': 473591}, \'multiverseid\': 473591}, {\'name\': \'Brochette de géant\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat à une créature, créez un jeton Nourriture. (C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)\\nÉquipement {3} ({3} : Attachez à la créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473860&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2d03f8c-1c6a-45ce-8d4f-ecc5151ac3d0\', \'multiverseId\': 473860}, \'multiverseid\': 473860}, {\'name\': \'Spiedo del Gigante\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento a una creatura, crea una pedina Cibo. (È un artefatto con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\\nEquipaggiare {3} ({3}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8be080b9-0107-4769-b5ae-2269eef7f0fb\', \'multiverseId\': 474129}, \'multiverseid\': 474129}, {\'name\': \'巨人の串\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーがクリーチャー１体に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、食物・トークンを１つ生成する。（それは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n装備{3}（{3}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95c79000-6f23-4756-8ae5-b91655d8ce8c\', \'multiverseId\': 474398}, \'multiverseid\': 474398}, {\'name\': \'거인의 꼬챙이\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +2/+1을 받는다.\\n장착된 생물이 생물에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 음식 토큰 한 개를 만든다. (음식 토큰은 "{2}, {T}, 이 마법물체를 희생한다: 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다."를 가진 마법물체이다.)\\n장착 {3} ({3}: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 이 장비를 부착한다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 장착할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3921c495-a49e-4f69-a78b-e14cbe34e84c\', \'multiverseId\': 474667}, \'multiverseid\': 474667}, {\'name\': \'Espeto do Gigante\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+1.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada causar dano de combate a uma criatura, crie uma ficha de Comida. (Ela é um artefato com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida.")\\nEquipar {3} ({3}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e19f627-ca88-4019-8790-1544e6577618\', \'multiverseId\': 474936}, \'multiverseid\': 474936}, {\'name\': \'Вертел Великана\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +2/+1.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо наносит боевые повреждения существу, создайте одну фишку Еды. (Она является артефактом со способностью «{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: вы получаете 3 жизни».)\\nСнарядить {3} ({3}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'267a11c0-a303-4624-a0d6-9f630384c17c\', \'multiverseId\': 475205}, \'multiverseid\': 475205}, {\'name\': \'巨人烤叉\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+1。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物对任一生物造成战斗伤害时，派出一个食品衍生物。（食品衍生物是具有「{2}，{T}，牺牲此神器：你获得3点生命」的神器。）\\n佩带{3}（{3}：装备在目标由你操控的生物上。佩带的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'886684f5-0ed9-4037-ba2e-3717cd62033b\', \'multiverseId\': 475474}, \'multiverseid\': 475474}, {\'name\': \'巨人烤叉\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+1。\\n每當佩帶此武具的生物對任一生物造成戰鬥傷害時，派出一個食品衍生物。（食品衍生物是具有「{2}，{T}，犧牲此神器：你獲得3點生命」的神器。）\\n佩帶{3}（{3}：裝備在目標由你操控的生物上。佩帶的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c383927-aa8c-4217-81de-c20b7c2a566c\', \'multiverseId\': 475743}, \'multiverseid\': 475743}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brennendes Drachenfeuer\', \'text\': \'Das Brennende Drachenfeuer fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls die Kreatur bzw. der Planeswalker in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie bzw. ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Feuersbrunst auf sie zuraste, schloss Syr Ameril die Augen und stellte sich Schloss Ardenthal vor, damit ihr letzter Gedanke ihrem Zuhause galt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473370&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acd7ecc2-1b17-4acb-a2a7-73762e69727e\', \'multiverseId\': 473370}, \'multiverseid\': 473370}, {\'name\': \'Fuegodragón abrasador\', \'text\': \'El Fuegodragón abrasador hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo. Si esa criatura o planeswalker fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras la llamarada se acercaba, Syr Ameril cerró los ojos e imaginó el castillo del Valle de Arden para que sus últimos pensamientos regresaran a casa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afab16df-ef22-4431-aa3e-4cbdeb99d585\', \'multiverseId\': 473639}, \'multiverseid\': 473639}, {\'name\': \'Feu du dragon dévastateur\', \'text\': \'Le Feu du dragon dévastateur inflige 3 blessures à la créature ciblée ou au planeswalker ciblé. Si cette créature ou ce planeswalker devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-le à la place.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "À l\'approche du brasier, Syr Ameril ferma les yeux et s\'imagina le château Ardenval afin que ses dernières pensées soient pour son foyer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473908&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b01fff96-f69e-4674-9812-34dd9d03a39c\', \'multiverseId\': 473908}, \'multiverseid\': 473908}, {\'name\': \'Fuoco Draconico Ustionante\', \'text\': \'Il Fuoco Draconico Ustionante infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio. Se quella creatura o quel planeswalker stanno per morire in questo turno, invece esiliali.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre le fiamme correvano verso di lei, Syr Ameril chiuse gli occhi e immaginò il Castello di Ardenvalle, perché i suoi ultimi pensieri la riportassero a casa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f65eb88-603a-4da5-b9d0-de9049d20cd7\', \'multiverseId\': 474177}, \'multiverseid\': 474177}, {\'name\': \'焦熱の竜火\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。焦熱の竜火はそれに３点のダメージを与える。このターン、そのクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'炎が押し寄せてくると、アメリル卿は目を閉じてアーデンベイル城を思い浮かべた。最後の記憶が故郷となるように。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f6d157a-ac9c-4841-964e-8ace6eb73ce0\', \'multiverseId\': 474446}, \'multiverseid\': 474446}, {\'name\': \'잿더미로 만드는 용의 불\', \'text\': \'생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 잿더미로 만드는 용의 불은 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다. 그 생물 또는 플레인즈워커가 이 턴에 죽게 된다면, 대신 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'불길이 다가오기 시작하자, 아메릴 경은 그녀의 눈을 감고 자신의 마지막 생각이 고향에 대한 것이 되길 바라며 아르덴베일 성을 추억했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f0579ea-a488-42ab-92b3-a35728c7b676\', \'multiverseId\': 474715}, \'multiverseid\': 474715}, {\'name\': \'Fogo Dracônico Escaldante\', \'text\': \'Fogo Dracônico Escaldante causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo. Se aquela criatura ou aquele planeswalker morreria neste turno, em vez disso, exile-o.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Quando as chamas vieram na direção dela, Syr Ameril fechou os olhos e visualizou o castelo do Vale Arden para que seus últimos pensamentos se voltassem para o lar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e25d69-3f9a-4339-a402-efea4fdbcebd\', \'multiverseId\': 474984}, \'multiverseid\': 474984}, {\'name\': \'Жгучее Драконье Пламя\', \'text\': \'Жгучее Драконье Пламя наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или planeswalker-у. Если то существо или planeswalker должно умереть в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Когда пламя устремилось к ней, сейра Америл закрыла глаза и представила замок Арденвейл, чтобы ее последние мысли были о доме.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac1bf173-9f8d-4560-a1e2-9024116a7c0d\', \'multiverseId\': 475253}, \'multiverseid\': 475253}, {\'name\': \'焦热龙炎\', \'text\': \'焦热龙炎对目标生物或鹏洛客造成3点伤害。如果本回合中该生物或鹏洛客将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'眼见来袭火焰即将吞没自己，艾默莉爵士索性闭上双眼，在脑海中回想起雅登瓦堡的点点滴滴，好让家乡成为自己最后的回忆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a59e268e-ee90-445f-8f38-a64b67968c69\', \'multiverseId\': 475522}, \'multiverseid\': 475522}, {\'name\': \'焦熱龍炎\', \'text\': \'焦熱龍炎對目標生物或鵬洛客造成3點傷害。如果本回合中該生物或鵬洛客將死去，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'眼見來襲火焰即將吞沒自己，艾默莉爵士索性閉上雙眼，在腦海中回想起雅登瓦堡的點點滴滴，好讓家鄉成為自己最後的回憶。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'626ab96f-13e7-4e59-a16e-7559278171d7\', \'multiverseId\': 475791}, \'multiverseid\': 475791}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bringerin des Schweigens\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nKreaturen, die ins Spiel kommen oder sterben, lösen keine Fähigkeiten aus.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Lass uns dieses Gespräch neu beginnen, und diesmal hörst du nur zu."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473249&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f221ab2c-cdc3-4743-aba0-6c7e0a63a52c\', \'multiverseId\': 473249}, \'multiverseid\': 473249}, {\'name\': \'Emisaria del silencio\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vínculo vital.\\nLas criaturas no hacen que se disparen habilidades cuando entran al campo de batalla o mueren.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hada\', \'flavor\': \'"Comencemos de nuevo esta conversación; esta vez solo escucharás".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb2fa97-bf4d-46cf-a118-7db51c045b8b\', \'multiverseId\': 473518}, \'multiverseid\': 473518}, {\'name\': \'Silençante\', \'text\': \'Vol, lien de vie\\nLes créatures qui arrivent sur le champ de bataille ou qui meurent ne provoquent pas le déclenchement des capacités.\', \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée\', \'flavor\': "« Reprenons cette conversation depuis le début, mais cette fois, vous vous contenterez d\'écouter. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473787&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fce1324-7f7a-42e0-9de8-beaa6be00645\', \'multiverseId\': 473787}, \'multiverseid\': 473787}, {\'name\': \'Portatrice del Silenzio\', \'text\': \'Volare, legame vitale\\nLe creature che entrano nel campo di battaglia o muoiono non fanno innescare le abilità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'"Iniziamo da capo la conversazione e questa volta ti limiterai ad ascoltare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f91a02cf-486f-4da7-8465-a39a8dac0046\', \'multiverseId\': 474056}, \'multiverseid\': 474056}, {\'name\': \'静寂をもたらすもの\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\nクリーチャーが戦場に出るか死亡することによっては、能力は誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー\', \'flavor\': \'「もう一度お話ししましょう。今度はあなたは聞くだけよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9992d2ab-3109-4505-925a-117564385fd7\', \'multiverseId\': 474325}, \'multiverseid\': 474325}, {\'name\': \'정적을 가져오는 자\', \'text\': \'비행, 생명연결\\n전장에 들어오거나 죽는 생물들은 능력을 격발시키지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 페어리\', \'flavor\': \'"이 대화를 다시 시작하도록 하지, 그리고 이번에 넌 듣기만 하는 거야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7240654c-3fd7-47fd-adaf-49decd3a8f9d\', \'multiverseId\': 474594}, \'multiverseid\': 474594}, {\'name\': \'Portadora da Quietude\', \'text\': \'Voar, vínculo com a vida\\nAs criaturas que entram no campo de batalha ou morrem não desencadeiam habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos recomeçar essa conversa. Dessa vez você só ouve."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3968b32e-4340-430c-9f3f-1f7f2b5f6b87\', \'multiverseId\': 474863}, \'multiverseid\': 474863}, {\'name\': \'Утихомиривательница\', \'text\': \'Полет, Цепь жизни\\nВыходящие на поле битвы или умирающие существа не вызывают срабатывание способностей.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Фея\', \'flavor\': \'«Давай начнем наш разговор заново, но на этот раз ты будешь только слушать».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d88898b-625d-41f2-a64b-428c9a1e8f4c\', \'multiverseId\': 475132}, \'multiverseid\': 475132}, {\'name\': \'静音仙子\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命\\n进战场或死去的生物不会触发异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵\', \'flavor\': \'「让我们再重新开始这段对话，但这次你只能听。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57487be2-6b50-4c38-8122-34956e6a9b3f\', \'multiverseId\': 475401}, \'multiverseid\': 475401}, {\'name\': \'靜音仙子\', \'text\': \'飛行，繫命\\n進戰場或死去的生物不會觸發異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙靈\', \'flavor\': \'「讓我們再重新開始這段對話，但這次你只能聽。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'377ff74c-1502-416d-941a-9df2adfb4f9e\', \'multiverseId\': 475670}, \'multiverseid\': 475670}]', '[{\'name\': \'Böse Stiefmutter\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Böse Stiefmutter ins Spiel kommt, kannst du sie einer anderen Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, 2 Schadenspunkte zufügen lassen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Manche sind zu Großem geboren. Du bist dazu geboren, die Böden der Großen zu schrubben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473340&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3562e6e-3051-48db-acd9-d05f8a3343e2\', \'multiverseId\': 473340}, \'multiverseid\': 473340}, {\'name\': \'Guardiana vil\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Guardiana vil entre al campo de batalla, puedes hacer que le haga 2 puntos de daño a otra criatura que controlas. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Algunos venimos de alta cuna. Tú naciste para fregar los suelos de esas cunas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45d7a5b4-5dd3-401c-817e-b821299efb08\', \'multiverseId\': 473609}, \'multiverseid\': 473609}, {\'name\': \'Méchante marâtre\', \'text\': "Quand la Méchante marâtre arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez faire qu\'elle inflige 2 blessures à une autre créature que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': \'« Certains naissent pour connaître la grandeur. Toi tu es née pour en récurer le sol. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473878&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8e8010f-2057-4a32-8c25-f9a6ffd60b98\', \'multiverseId\': 473878}, \'multiverseid\': 473878}, {\'name\': \'Tutrice Malvagia\', \'text\': "Quando la Tutrice Malvagia entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi farle infliggere 2 danni a un\'altra creatura che controlli. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Alcuni nascono per fare grandi cose. Tu sei nata per pulire grandi pavimenti."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3b8f7af-62cc-481b-928f-a8af2a11d7d6\', \'multiverseId\': 474147}, \'multiverseid\': 474147}, {\'name\': \'意地悪な後見人\', \'text\': \'意地悪な後見人が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「意地悪な後見人はあなたがコントロールしている他のクリーチャー１体に２点のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「生まれながらに偉大な者もいるけど、お前は生まれながらに、偉大な者の床を磨くことになっているんだよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee209fb0-51f6-4cf0-b0ef-83432f7e8f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 474416}, \'multiverseid\': 474416}, {\'name\': \'사악한 후견인\', \'text\': \'사악한 후견인이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 사악한 후견인이 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물에게 피해 2점을 입히게 할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 귀족\', \'flavor\': \'"위대함을 지니고 태어나는 자들은 얼마 안 되지. 너는 그 위대한 자들이 거니는 마룻바닥을 닦으려고 태어난 거고."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e7fe993-9cfa-488e-bd5e-45d500076d0b\', \'multiverseId\': 474685}, \'multiverseid\': 474685}, {\'name\': \'Guardiã Malvada\', \'text\': \'Quando Guardiã Malvada entra no campo de batalha, você pode fazer com que ela cause 2 pontos de dano a outra criatura que você controla. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'"Alguns nascem para a grandeza. Você nasceu para limpar o chão da grandeza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f569d6c-6382-4327-b52e-7d1e35a03f33\', \'multiverseId\': 474954}, \'multiverseid\': 474954}, {\'name\': \'Жестокая Опекунша\', \'text\': \'Когда Жестокая Опекунша выходит на поле битвы, вы можете заставить ее нанести 2 повреждения другому существу под вашим контролем. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Аристократ\', \'flavor\': \'«Некоторые рождены для величия. Ты рождена, чтобы мыть величию полы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49044623-4497-49ba-98c9-0060dc1b24a8\', \'multiverseId\': 475223}, \'multiverseid\': 475223}, {\'name\': \'邪恶守护者\', \'text\': \'当邪恶守护者进战场时，你可以令它对另一个由你操控的生物造成2点伤害。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「有些人生来就是伟人。而你生来就是给伟人擦地板的。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e069cc5c-3875-4c7b-8d05-513ac0a01e9f\', \'multiverseId\': 475492}, \'multiverseid\': 475492}, {\'name\': \'邪惡守護者\', \'text\': \'當邪惡守護者進戰場時，你可以令它對另一個由你操控的生物造成2點傷害。若你如此作，則抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「有些人生來就是偉人。而你生來就是給偉人擦地板的。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bc60ad9-8bca-4589-b6ad-7a5950be5111\', \'multiverseId\': 475761}, \'multiverseid\': 475761}]', '[{\'name\': \'Böser Wolf\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Böse Wolf ins Spiel kommt, kämpft er gegen bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst.\\nOpfere eine Speise: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Bösen Wolf. Er erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Tappe ihn.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473412&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da56b45e-a1ca-4a94-8fa7-fdf4c50d8ded\', \'multiverseId\': 473412}, \'multiverseid\': 473412}, {\'name\': \'Lobo feroz\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Lobo feroz entre al campo de batalla, lucha contra hasta una criatura objetivo que no controlas.\\nSacrificar una Comida: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Lobo feroz. Gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. Gíralo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21da5b02-8f3f-4f24-abb7-f952cb7dbb11\', \'multiverseId\': 473681}, \'multiverseid\': 473681}, {\'name\': \'Méchant loup\', \'text\': "Quand le Méchant loup arrive sur le champ de bataille, il se bat contre jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.\\nSacrifiez une nourriture : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Méchant loup. Il acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Engagez-le.", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473950&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7f7134b-3610-4b75-aab3-6e866f6d23db\', \'multiverseId\': 473950}, \'multiverseid\': 473950}, {\'name\': \'Lupo Cattivo\', \'text\': \'Quando il Lupo Cattivo entra nel campo di battaglia, lotta con fino a una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.\\nSacrifica un Cibo: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Lupo Cattivo. Ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. TAPpalo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f5457b3-4ad4-4d7b-b92f-7c52800eca57\', \'multiverseId\': 474219}, \'multiverseid\': 474219}, {\'name\': \'意地悪な狼\', \'text\': \'意地悪な狼が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。これはそれと格闘を行う。\\n食物１つを生け贄に捧げる：意地悪な狼の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。ターン終了時まで、これは破壊不能を得る。これをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92bd1e28-0c02-4f85-acaf-439b625ca8c8\', \'multiverseId\': 474488}, \'multiverseid\': 474488}, {\'name\': \'사악한 늑대\', \'text\': \'사악한 늑대가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 사악한 늑대는 그 생물과 싸운다.\\n음식 한 개를 희생한다: 사악한 늑대에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 사악한 늑대는 턴종료까지 무적을 얻는다. 사악한 늑대를 탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f0f8a75-0bba-4348-b854-2384e40a6627\', \'multiverseId\': 474757}, \'multiverseid\': 474757}, {\'name\': \'Lobo Mau\', \'text\': \'Quando Lobo Mau entra no campo de batalha, ele luta com até uma criatura alvo que você não controla.\\nSacrifique uma Comida: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Lobo Mau. Ele ganha indestrutível até o final do turno. Vire-o.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49119906-e23c-432f-8ab3-0816bcd39474\', \'multiverseId\': 475026}, \'multiverseid\': 475026}, {\'name\': \'Злобный Волк\', \'text\': \'Когда Злобный Волк выходит на поле битвы, он дерется не более чем с одним целевым существом не под вашим контролем.\\nПожертвуйте Еду: положите один жетон +1/+1 на Злобного Волка. Он получает Неразрушимость до конца хода. Поверните его.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Волк\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a8465b6-811a-41d3-be11-2d80ff039464\', \'multiverseId\': 475295}, \'multiverseid\': 475295}, {\'name\': \'恶狼\', \'text\': \'当恶狼进战场时，它与至多一个目标不由你操控的生物互斗。\\n牺牲一个食品：在恶狼上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它获得不灭异能直到回合结束。将之横置。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84299c02-ef27-407f-8533-6c62313f25da\', \'multiverseId\': 475564}, \'multiverseid\': 475564}, {\'name\': \'惡狼\', \'text\': \'當惡狼進戰場時，它與至多一個目標不由你操控的生物互鬥。\\n犧牲一個食品：在惡狼上放置一個+1/+1指示物。它獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。將之橫置。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc00f640-b5ee-4594-9c22-8864ac213942\', \'multiverseId\': 475833}, \'multiverseid\': 475833}]', "[{'name': 'Das Questentier', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit, Todesberührung, Eile\\nDas Questentier kann von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.\\nKampfschaden, den Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, zufügen würden, kann nicht verhindert werden.\\nImmer wenn Das Questentier einem Gegner Kampfschaden zufügt, fügt es einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl, den jener Spieler kontrolliert, ebenso viele Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Bestie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473402&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05178463-3dcc-40c8-839b-0793337f261c', 'multiverseId': 473402}, 'multiverseid': 473402}, {'name': 'La Bestia Buscada', 'text': 'Vigilancia, toque mortal, prisa.\\nLa Bestia Buscada no puede ser bloqueada por criaturas con fuerza de 2 o menos.\\nEl daño de combate que fueran a hacer las criaturas que controlas no puede ser prevenido.\\nSiempre que La Bestia Buscada haga daño de combate a un oponente, hace esa misma cantidad de daño al planeswalker objetivo que controla ese jugador.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Bestia', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473671&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2343c80-2c1c-4a29-b8d7-10d0e6b5986e', 'multiverseId': 473671}, 'multiverseid': 473671}, {'name': 'Bête de Quête', 'text': 'Vigilance, contact mortel, célérité\\nLa Bête de Quête ne peut pas être bloquée par les créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2.\\nLes blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées par des créatures que vous contrôlez ne peuvent pas être prévenues.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Bête de Quête inflige des blessures de combat à un adversaire, elle inflige autant de blessures à un planeswalker ciblé que ce joueur contrôle.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : bête', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473940&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ea45a5b-d9b7-463a-9cfa-1b17c20d32bb', 'multiverseId': 473940}, 'multiverseid': 473940}, {'name': 'Bestia dei Cimenti', 'text': 'Cautela, tocco letale, rapidità\\nLa Bestia dei Cimenti non può essere bloccata da creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\\nIl danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto dalle creature che controlli non può essere prevenuto.\\nOgniqualvolta la Bestia dei Cimenti infligge danno da combattimento a un avversario, infligge altrettanti danni a un planeswalker bersaglio controllato da quel giocatore.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Bestia', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474209&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92d26c1f-6f45-4d9a-973e-834555b295aa', 'multiverseId': 474209}, 'multiverseid': 474209}, {'name': '探索する獣', 'text': '警戒、接死、速攻\\n探索する獣は、パワーが２以下のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが与える戦闘ダメージは軽減できない。\\n探索する獣が対戦相手１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。これはそれに、その点数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474478&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cae2d4d0-3fad-4e7d-9020-a6cb14b5aee8', 'multiverseId': 474478}, 'multiverseid': 474478}, {'name': '탐색하는 야수', 'text': '경계, 치명타, 신속\\n탐색하는 야수는 공격력이 2 이하인 생물에게 방어될 수 없다.\\n당신이 조종하는 생물들이 입히려 하는 전투피해는 방지될 수 없다.\\n탐색하는 야수가 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어가 조종하는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 탐색하는 야수는 그 플레인즈워커에게 그만큼의 피해를 입힌다.', 'type': '전설적 생물 — 야수', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474747&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c68ac05b-95e1-4370-b8e3-8f3806656aa1', 'multiverseId': 474747}, 'multiverseid': 474747}, {'name': 'Fera das Demandas', 'text': 'Vigilância, toque mortífero, ímpeto\\nFera das Demandas não pode ser bloqueada por criaturas de poder igual ou inferior a 2.\\nO dano de combate que seria causado por criaturas que você controla não pode ser prevenido.\\nToda vez que Fera das Demandas causa dano de combate a um oponente, ela causa uma quantidade equivalente de dano ao planeswalker alvo que aquele jogador controla.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Besta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475016&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f770414-8445-42cc-bee1-7fdf2c19c2fb', 'multiverseId': 475016}, 'multiverseid': 475016}, {'name': 'Заветное Чудище', 'text': 'Бдительность, Смертельное касание, Ускорение\\nЗаветное Чудище не может быть заблокировано существами с силой 2 или меньше.\\nБоевые повреждения, которые должны нанести существа под вашим контролем, не могут быть предотвращены.\\nКаждый раз, когда Заветное Чудище наносит боевые повреждения оппоненту, оно наносит столько же повреждений целевому planeswalker-у под контролем того игрока.', 'type': 'Легендарное Существо — Зверь', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475285&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b7b97c6-a60b-46d1-9883-fce35d30d736', 'multiverseId': 475285}, 'multiverseid': 475285}, {'name': '寻水兽', 'text': '警戒，死触，敏捷\\n寻水兽不能被力量等于或小于2的生物阻挡。\\n由你操控之生物所造成的战斗伤害不能被防止。\\n每当寻水兽向任一对手造成战斗伤害时，它对目标由该牌手操控的鹏洛客造成等量的伤害。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～野兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475554&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38e598d9-3c79-4416-9029-c8ea54772f92', 'multiverseId': 475554}, 'multiverseid': 475554}, {'name': '尋水獸', 'text': '警戒，死觸，敏捷\\n尋水獸不能被力量等於或小於2的生物阻擋。\\n由你操控之生物所造成的戰鬥傷害不能被防止。\\n每當尋水獸向任一對手造成戰鬥傷害時，它對目標由該玩家操控的鵬洛客造成等量的傷害。', 'type': '傳奇生物 ～野獸', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475823&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a6d2280a-1254-41fd-9f46-06d0b35c3cca', 'multiverseId': 475823}, 'multiverseid': 475823}]", '[{\'name\': \'Der Große Steinkreis\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der höchsten Stärke unter den Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}{G}. Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie und ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473392&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae3f5a43-d270-482f-a9e0-ff1d9860689e\', \'multiverseId\': 473392}, \'multiverseid\': 473392}, {\'name\': \'El Gran Crómlech\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {X} menos lanzar este hechizo, donde X es la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que controlas.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}{G}. Ganas 2 vidas.\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella y roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'629e9e8d-0b19-40c3-97aa-32efa6816f48\', \'multiverseId\': 473661}, \'multiverseid\': 473661}, {\'name\': \'Le Grand Cromlech\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {X} de moins à lancer, X étant la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}{G}. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle et piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473930&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5df9049b-d76b-4940-90b1-6abddd73078d\', \'multiverseId\': 473930}, \'multiverseid\': 473930}, {\'name\': \'Il Grande Monolito\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {X} in meno per essere lanciata, dove X è la forza maggiore tra le creature che controlli.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}{G}. Guadagni 2 punti vita.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura non pedina entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa e pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40003af8-88cf-45c5-b0c9-d530d0c2aa42\', \'multiverseId\': 474199}, \'multiverseid\': 474199}, {\'name\': \'グレートヘンジ\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの中のパワーの最大値に等しい。\\n{T}：{G}{G}を加える。あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\nトークンでないクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置き、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a57d3f4-fd0e-4f57-8ae6-12991f7151e2\', \'multiverseId\': 474468}, \'multiverseid\': 474468}, {\'name\': \'거대한 헨지\', \'text\': \'이 주문은 발동하는 비용이 {X}만큼 덜 든다. X는 당신이 조종하는 생물 중 공격력이 제일 높은 생물의 공격력이다.\\n{T}: {G}{G}를 추가한다. 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\\n토큰이 아닌 생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓고 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51689cdc-dcf9-48ac-9102-aeba757425c9\', \'multiverseId\': 474737}, \'multiverseid\': 474737}, {\'name\': \'O Grande Círculo\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {X} a menos para ser conjurada, sendo X o maior poder entre os das criaturas que você controla.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}{G}. Você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\\nToda vez que uma criatura que não seja uma ficha entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela e compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9aae01c-44f1-48ca-8fb7-a8fce08f9465\', \'multiverseId\': 475006}, \'multiverseid\': 475006}, {\'name\': \'Великий Кромлех\', \'text\': \'Стоимость разыгрывания этого заклинания уменьшается на {X}, где Х — наибольшее значение силы среди существ под вашим контролем.\\n{T}: добавьте {G}{G}. Вы получаете 2 жизни.\\nКаждый раз, когда не являющееся фишкой существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, положите на него один жетон +1/+1 и возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6007d2fd-dc3f-4108-ab5b-7b229d927a42\', \'multiverseId\': 475275}, \'multiverseid\': 475275}, {\'name\': \'巨石圆阵\', \'text\': \'此咒语减少{X}来施放，X为由你操控的生物中力量最大者的数值。\\n{T}：加{G}{G}。你获得2点生命。\\n每当一个非衍生物的生物在你的操控下进战场时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物且抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8c5a8e7-b220-4382-a0d7-9e300528b188\', \'multiverseId\': 475544}, \'multiverseid\': 475544}, {\'name\': \'巨石圓陣\', \'text\': \'此咒語減少{X}來施放，X為由你操控的生物中力量最大者的數值。\\n{T}：加{G}{G}。你獲得2點生命。\\n每當一個非衍生物的生物在你的操控下進戰場時，在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物且抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8069ab54-e38f-4dd6-b015-c9a9575145c5\', \'multiverseId\': 475813}, \'multiverseid\': 475813}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Zauberspiegel\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Spontanzauber- und Hexerei-Karte in deinem Friedhof {1} weniger.\\nDu hast keine maximale Handkartenzahl.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments legst du eine Wissensmarke auf den Zauberspiegel und ziehst dann für jede Wissensmarke auf dem Zauberspiegel eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473282&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac42dce9-e27b-471c-bc77-5bb4ae5ad258\', \'multiverseId\': 473282}, \'multiverseid\': 473282}, {\'name\': \'El Espejo Mágico\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada carta de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio.\\nTu mano no tiene tamaño máximo.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon un contador de conocimiento sobre El Espejo Mágico. Luego, roba una carta por cada contador de conocimiento sobre El Espejo Mágico.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cf44cd2-972d-466f-bb98-c3f2f1ebe5d3\', \'multiverseId\': 473551}, \'multiverseid\': 473551}, {\'name\': \'Le Miroir magique\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque carte d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière.\\nIl n\'y a pas de limite au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\nAu début de votre entretien, mettez un marqueur « connaissance » sur Le Miroir magique, puis piochez une carte pour chaque marqueur « connaissance » sur Le Miroir magique.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473820&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83d674c2-6ba6-4b24-a0be-b245cecad90e\', \'multiverseId\': 473820}, \'multiverseid\': 473820}, {\'name\': \'Lo Specchio Magico\', \'text\': "Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni carta istantaneo e stregoneria nel tuo cimitero.\\nNon hai un limite massimo di carte nella tua mano.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti un segnalino conoscenza su Lo Specchio Magico, poi pesca una carta per ogni segnalino conoscenza su Lo Specchio Magico.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13b7fce4-03d0-414d-bb92-b957e7f21ac8\', \'multiverseId\': 474089}, \'multiverseid\': 474089}, {\'name\': \'魔法の鏡\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚につき{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、魔法の鏡の上に知識カウンターを１個置き、その後魔法の鏡の上に置かれている知識カウンター１個につきカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85957fe0-325f-4309-921e-32673b2eb9ed\', \'multiverseId\': 474358}, \'multiverseid\': 474358}, {\'name\': \'마법 거울\', \'text\': \'이 주문은 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법 및 집중마법 카드 한 장당 발동하는 데 {1}이 덜 든다.\\n당신의 손은 크기 제한이 없다.\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 마법 거울에 지식 카운터 한 개를 올려놓은 후, 마법 거울에 올려진 지식 카운터 수만큼 카드를 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c78fa972-cc4e-430a-a35f-d4bb66dd1109\', \'multiverseId\': 474627}, \'multiverseid\': 474627}, {\'name\': \'O Espelho Mágico\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada card de mágica instantânea ou feitiço em seu cemitério.\\nNão há limite para o número máximo de cards em sua mão.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, coloque um marcador de conhecimento em O Espelho Mágico. Em seguida, compre um card para cada marcador de conhecimento em O Espelho Mágico.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b77b93ae-4d45-4096-81ee-99985687ace5\', \'multiverseId\': 474896}, \'multiverseid\': 474896}, {\'name\': \'Волшебное Зеркало\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {1} меньше за каждую карту мгновенного заклинания и волшебства на вашем кладбище.\\nРазмер вашей руки неограничен.\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки положите один жетон познаний на Волшебное Зеркало, затем возьмите одну карту за каждый жетон познаний на Волшебном Зеркале.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c247b179-5a3d-4fe8-89b5-07b7c80faabd\', \'multiverseId\': 475165}, \'multiverseid\': 475165}, {\'name\': \'魔法明镜\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中每有一张瞬间与法术牌，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n你的手牌数量没有上限。\\n在你的维持开始时，在魔法明镜上放置一个知识指示物，然后魔法明镜上每有一个知识指示物，便抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d10d10f-f0b0-4a80-8ff4-4370b1c608b3\', \'multiverseId\': 475434}, \'multiverseid\': 475434}, {\'name\': \'魔法明鏡\', \'text\': \'你墳墓場中每有一張瞬間與巫術牌，此咒語便減少{1}來施放。\\n你的手牌數量沒有上限。\\n在你的維持開始時，在魔法明鏡上放置一個知識指示物，然後魔法明鏡上每有一個知識指示物，便抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea5e49a7-dfb6-459e-af2f-31ce5b3b3996\', \'multiverseId\': 475703}, \'multiverseid\': 475703}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Kinder des Königs\', \'text\': \'+1: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\\n+1: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+0 und Erstschlag und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n—8: Ziehe vier Karten. Wenn du dies tust, fügen die Kinder des Königs einem Ziel deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie du Karten auf deiner Hand hast.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Will, Rowan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473430&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'002f7a17-5049-4125-ba90-09d22dc35254\', \'multiverseId\': 473430}, \'multiverseid\': 473430}, {\'name\': \'Los Vástagos Reales\', \'text\': \'+1: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\\n+1: La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 y gana las habilidades de dañar primero y arrollar hasta el final del turno.\\n−8: Roba cuatro cartas. Cuando lo hagas, Los Vástagos Reales hacen una cantidad de daño a cualquier objetivo igual a la cantidad de cartas en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Will Rowan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'006766fe-57b2-4abe-a319-991629b6cf46\', \'multiverseId\': 473699}, \'multiverseid\': 473699}, {\'name\': \'Les Scions royaux\', \'text\': "+1 : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\n+1 : La créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 et acquiert l\'initiative et le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n-8 : Piochez quatre cartes. Quand vous faites ainsi, Les Scions royaux infligent à n\'importe quelle cible un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de cartes dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Will et Rowan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473968&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69ca98bc-1726-4aa3-b0d1-cd55ad489cb4\', \'multiverseId\': 473968}, \'multiverseid\': 473968}, {\'name\': \'I Discendenti Reali\', \'text\': \'+1: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\\n+1: Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 e ha attacco improvviso e travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\\n-8: Pesca quattro carte. Quando lo fai, I Discendenti Reali infliggono a un qualsiasi bersaglio danno pari al numero di carte nella tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Will Rowan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'913a922b-b064-410a-8e64-15e3452d6e76\', \'multiverseId\': 474237}, \'multiverseid\': 474237}, {\'name\': \'王家の跡継ぎ\', \'text\': \'+1：カードを１枚引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\\n+1：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受け先制攻撃とトランプルを得る。\\n-8：カードを４枚引く。＠そうしたとき、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。王家の跡継ぎはそれにあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ウィル・ローアン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5e929b6-d574-4359-b45c-7d619e8b935a\', \'multiverseId\': 474506}, \'multiverseid\': 474506}, {\'name\': \'왕가의 자손\', \'text\': \'+1: 카드 한 장을 뽑은 후, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\\n+1: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받고 선제공격 및 돌진을 얻는다.\\n−8: 카드 네 장을 뽑는다. 그렇게 할 때, 원하는 목표를 정한다. 왕가의 자손은 그 목표에게 당신의 손에 있는 카드 수만큼 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 윌 로완\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b7dd986-2c68-43ad-bcdf-8a815c48fe2c\', \'multiverseId\': 474775}, \'multiverseid\': 474775}, {\'name\': \'Os Herdeiros Reais\', \'text\': \'+1: Compre um card e depois descarte um card.\\n+1: A criatura alvo recebe +2/+0 e ganha iniciativa e atropelar até o final do turno.\\n−8: Compre quatro cards. Quando você faz isso, Os Herdeiros Reais causa a qualquer alvo uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de cards em sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Will Rowan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e404ef28-7d0c-41bd-97d2-547b81b83731\', \'multiverseId\': 475044}, \'multiverseid\': 475044}, {\'name\': \'Королевские Отпрыски\', \'text\': \'+1: возьмите карту, затем сбросьте карту.\\n+1: целевое существо получает +2/+0, Первый удар и Пробивной удар до конца хода.\\n—8: возьмите четыре карты. Когда вы это делаете, Королевские Отпрыски наносят любой цели повреждения, равные количеству карт в вашей руке.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Уилл Рован\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5c653e3-a5d8-4300-be18-000ac4146b73\', \'multiverseId\': 475313}, \'multiverseid\': 475313}, {\'name\': \'皇族双子\', \'text\': \'+1：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\\n+1：直到回合结束，目标生物得+2/+0且获得先攻与践踏异能。\\n−8：抓四张牌。当你如此作时，皇族双子对任意一个目标造成等同于你手牌数量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～威尔／萝婉\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3746222d-184b-41d7-9c5d-4fc567141bda\', \'multiverseId\': 475582}, \'multiverseid\': 475582}, {\'name\': \'皇族雙子\', \'text\': \'+1：抽一張牌，然後棄一張牌。\\n+1：直到回合結束，目標生物得+2/+0且獲得先攻與踐踏異能。\\n−8：抽四張牌。當你如此作時，皇族雙子對任意一個目標造成等同於你手牌數量的傷害。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～威爾／蘿婉\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27788733-c9a5-4516-a2e8-b96ac2234a8e\', \'multiverseId\': 475851}, \'multiverseid\': 475851}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnernder Schnapper\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 5 oder mehr wirkst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schildkröte, Hydra\', \'flavor\': \'Während Menschen nur ohrenbetäubendes Brüllen hören, hören die Feen atemberaubend schöne Musik.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473446&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97374259-676c-43d4-a1b7-123a238767af\', \'multiverseId\': 473446}, \'multiverseid\': 473446}, {\'name\': \'Quelonio atronador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo con coste de maná convertido de 5 o más, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra tortuga\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras los humanos solo oyen un rugido ensordecedor, las hadas escuchan una música de una belleza impresionante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2075e082-61b0-439c-8970-9ebe71bb4aec\', \'multiverseId\': 473715}, \'multiverseid\': 473715}, {\'name\': \'Claqueur tonitruant\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort avec un coût converti de mana supérieur ou égal à 5, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : tortue terrestre et hydre\', \'flavor\': "Là où les humains n\'entendent qu\'un cri assourdissant, les fæs entendent une musique d\'une beauté époustouflante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473984&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ba315b8-f501-4c4c-a394-359093f7bfa7\', \'multiverseId\': 473984}, \'multiverseid\': 473984}, {\'name\': \'Mordace Tonante\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia con costo di mana convertito pari o superiore a 5, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra Tartaruga\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre gli umani percepiscono solo un ruggito assordante, le fate odono una melodia così soave da lasciarle senza fiato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27ad5284-9f5a-45a7-bdbf-e4a386010cc2\', \'multiverseId\': 474253}, \'multiverseid\': 474253}, {\'name\': \'雷声のカミツキガメ\', \'text\': \'あなたが、点数で見たマナ・コストが５以上の呪文を唱えるたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 海亀・ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': \'人間たちには耳をつんざくような叫びしか聞こえない一方で、フェイには息をのむほど美しい音楽が聞こえていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93f056bd-29f9-42a2-960c-a60eb9a7f419\', \'multiverseId\': 474522}, \'multiverseid\': 474522}, {\'name\': \'천둥 같은 거북\', \'text\': \'당신이 전환마나비용이 5 이상인 주문을 발동할 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거북이 히드라\', \'flavor\': \'인간들에게는 귀를 멀게 하는 포효만이 들리지만, 요정들에게는 숨을 멎게 하는 아름다운 음악 소리가 들린다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'665a6f9a-0cd6-41b7-bd5b-641c33e7d239\', \'multiverseId\': 474791}, \'multiverseid\': 474791}, {\'name\': \'Abocanhador Trovejante\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica com custo de mana convertido igual ou superior a 5, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tartaruga Hidra\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto os humanos ouvem apenas um rugido ensurdecedor, as fadinas ouvem uma música bonita de tirar o fôlego.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4b956c7-2999-416f-aba5-43fb798377ec\', \'multiverseId\': 475060}, \'multiverseid\': 475060}, {\'name\': \'Громогласная Черепаха\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание с конвертированной мана-стоимостью 5 или больше, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Черепаха Гидра\', \'flavor\': \'Там, где люди слышат только оглушительный рев, феи слышат музыку захватывающей дух красоты.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e341673-1e10-48d9-89b7-e81286afbce9\', \'multiverseId\': 475329}, \'multiverseid\': 475329}, {\'name\': \'雷动巨嘴龟\', \'text\': \'每当你施放总法术力费用等于或大于5的咒语时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龟／多头龙\', \'flavor\': \'传到人类耳中的，只有震耳欲聋的怒吼；而传到仙儿耳中的，则是美妙绝伦的天籁。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0b17a4c-e2a0-4e32-b7e4-96bf9c060458\', \'multiverseId\': 475598}, \'multiverseid\': 475598}, {\'name\': \'雷動巨嘴龜\', \'text\': \'每當你施放總魔法力費用等於或大於5的咒語時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龜／多頭龍\', \'flavor\': \'傳到人類耳中的，只有震耳欲聾的怒吼；而傳到仙兒耳中的，則是美妙絕倫的天籟。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adafe753-2097-4448-a855-d3267fc8c182\', \'multiverseId\': 475867}, \'multiverseid\': 475867}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dornburg-Hutzel\', \'text\': \'{8}: Die Dornburg-Hutzel hat Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 10/10 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du einen Oko-Planeswalker kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Buboh\', \'flavor\': \'So grausam Okos Witze auch sein mögen, das Lachen seiner Gefolgschaft ist ihm immer gewiss.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475939&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47c8c0e9-bb6e-41fd-a16b-80853d0c1900\', \'multiverseId\': 475939}, \'multiverseid\': 475939}, {\'name\': \'Despreciable de Fortalezarza\', \'text\': \'{8}: El Despreciable de Fortalezarza tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 10/10 hasta el final del turno. Activa esta habilidad solo si controlas un planeswalker Oko.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Oufé\', \'flavor\': \'No importa cuán crueles sean las bromas de Oko; siempre tiene garantizada la carcajada del sicofante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09811a2a-e569-4b13-831b-c09f40eb47fd\', \'multiverseId\': 475949}, \'multiverseid\': 475949}, {\'name\': \'Fourbe de Roncefort\', \'text\': "{8} : Le Fourbe de Roncefort a une force et une endurance de base de 10/10 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous contrôlez un planeswalker Oko.", \'type\': \'Créature : orphe\', \'flavor\': "Qu\'importe la cruauté des farces d\'Oko, il est sûr de faire rire le sycophante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475959&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47cce3db-8476-46fa-994d-2f86dd9abf0b\', \'multiverseId\': 475959}, \'multiverseid\': 475959}, {\'name\': \'Abietto di Fortespino\', \'text\': "{8}: L\'Abietto di Fortespino ha forza e costituzione base 10/10 fino alla fine del turno. Attiva questa abilità solo se controlli un planeswalker Oko.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ouphe\', \'flavor\': \'Per quanto le beffe di Oko siano crudeli, ci sarà sempre un adulatore pronto a riderne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be28683b-5d68-464d-af97-25207d4b8889\', \'multiverseId\': 475969}, \'multiverseid\': 475969}, {\'name\': \'棘茨砦の嫌われ者\', \'text\': \'{8}：ターン終了時まで、棘茨砦の嫌われ者は基本のパワーとタフネスが10/10になる。この能力は、あなたがオーコ・プレインズウォーカーをコントロールしているときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アウフ\', \'flavor\': \'オーコの冗談がどんなに残酷であっても、オーコに媚びる者は必ず笑う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66a0beec-b0d0-48c0-a483-eb6a9cdf01d0\', \'multiverseId\': 475979}, \'multiverseid\': 475979}, {\'name\': \'덤불요새 밀고자\', \'text\': \'{8}: 덤불요새 밀고자는 턴종료까지 기본 공격력과 방어력이 10/10이 된다. 이 능력은 당신이 오코 플레인즈워커를 조종할 때에만 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 아우프\', \'flavor\': \'오코의 농담이 아무리 잔인하더라도, 그는 항상 아첨꾼의 웃음소리를 들을 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63a9c7b0-f2cf-46a8-a86b-554f0baf9112\', \'multiverseId\': 475989}, \'multiverseid\': 475989}, {\'name\': \'Delator de Fortespinho\', \'text\': \'{8}: Delator de Fortespinho tem poder e resistência básicos 10/10 até o final do turno. Ative esta habilidade somente se controlar um planeswalker Oko.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Por mais cruéis que sejam as piadas de Oko, tem sempre um bajulador pronto a dar uma gargalhada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aa63d05-462d-4138-8cb4-4d86b325c346\', \'multiverseId\': 475999}, \'multiverseid\': 475999}, {\'name\': \'Прохвост из Терновой Крепости\', \'text\': \'{8}: Прохвост из Терновой Крепости имеет базовую силу и выносливость 10/10 до конца хода. Активируйте эту способность, только если вы контролируете planeswalker-а Око.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Уф\', \'flavor\': \'Как бы ни были жестоки шутки Око, он всегда услышит смех своих подхалимов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43fb5f04-2954-4176-a0b5-126e80fdf76e\', \'multiverseId\': 476009}, \'multiverseid\': 476009}, {\'name\': \'棘堡奥夫\', \'text\': \'{8}：棘堡奥夫之基础力量与防御力为10/10直到回合结束。只能于你操控瓯柯鹏洛客时起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～奥夫\', \'flavor\': \'无论瓯柯的玩笑有多残酷，都会有人发出谄媚的笑声。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74f68cfd-b404-43e4-8f75-ca99161a5f90\', \'multiverseId\': 476019}, \'multiverseid\': 476019}, {\'name\': \'棘堡奧夫\', \'text\': \'{8}：棘堡奧夫的基礎力量和防禦力為10/10直到回合結束。只能於你操控甌柯鵬洛客時起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～奧夫\', \'flavor\': \'無論甌柯的笑話多殘酷，都會有人發出諂媚的笑聲。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51f28ab5-ce60-4204-8bb0-2c3f5ced644f\', \'multiverseId\': 476029}, \'multiverseid\': 476029}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dornenpeitsche\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+1 und Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Noch eine wütende Menge? Wann lernen sie endlich, mich in Ruhe zu lassen?"\\n—Terryn, Wallstädt-Ausgestoßene\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473323&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cef8000-9e97-45db-9e06-87f4ae09df93\', \'multiverseId\': 473323}, \'multiverseid\': 473323}, {\'name\': \'Latigazo espinoso\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+1 y gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Otra multitud enfurecida? ¿Cuándo aprenderán a dejarme en paz?".\\n—Terryn, paria de Extremuro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c6155fe-d35a-4805-94bd-7608323f3fda\', \'multiverseId\': 473592}, \'multiverseid\': 473592}, {\'name\': "Fouet d\'épines", \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +2/+1 et acquiert le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Encore une foule en colère ? Quand apprendront-ils tous à me laisser en paix ? »\\n—Terryn, paria de Bornemur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473861&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a78df4c-608e-431d-a4d5-c7fff1a3f354\', \'multiverseId\': 473861}, \'multiverseid\': 473861}, {\'name\': \'Frustata di Spine\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+1 e ha tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un\\\'altra folla inferocita? Quando impareranno a lasciarmi in pace?"\\n—Terryn, reietta di Estremuro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed0a2336-62b2-457f-b2dd-f45872a9a942\', \'multiverseId\': 474130}, \'multiverseid\': 474130}, {\'name\': \'茨の鞭撃ち\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋１の修整を受け接死を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「また暴徒？いつになったら私を諦めてくれるの？」\\n――エッジウォールののけ者、テリン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97b5be56-6994-42f6-a6a7-9d9dcb010505\', \'multiverseId\': 474399}, \'multiverseid\': 474399}, {\'name\': \'가시의 채찍질\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+1를 받고 치명타를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"또 성난 군중이 나타났다고? 언제쯤이면 나를 가만히 내버려둬 주려나?"\\n—언저리방벽 외톨이, 테린\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d0b924f-6461-4467-a7a2-f812687632b3\', \'multiverseId\': 474668}, \'multiverseid\': 474668}, {\'name\': \'Chicotada Espinhosa\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +2/+1 e ganha toque mortífero até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Outra turba enfurecida? Quando é que eles vão aprender a me deixar em paz?"\\n— Terryn, renegado de Beiramuro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=474937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08fcab13-9423-4a04-a716-34007b05a472\', \'multiverseId\': 474937}, \'multiverseid\': 474937}, {\'name\': \'Шипастая Плеть\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +2/+1 и Смертельное касание до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Опять разъяренная толпа? Когда же они, наконец, поймут, что меня надо оставить в покое?»\\n—Тейрин, изгой с Пограничного Оплота\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f59b171f-591a-48ef-8886-1c45f9e0e820\', \'multiverseId\': 475206}, \'multiverseid\': 475206}, {\'name\': \'荆棘鞭击\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+2/+1且获得死触异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「又一群愤怒暴民？他们要到什么时候才晓得不该来烦我？」\\n～边墙镇黜人泰琳\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'223f6198-f994-40aa-9c68-c4a83998329e\', \'multiverseId\': 475475}, \'multiverseid\': 475475}, {\'name\': \'荊棘鞭擊\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標生物得+2/+1且獲得死觸異能。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「又一群憤怒暴民？他們要到什麼時候才曉得不該來煩我？」\\n～邊牆鎮黜人泰琳\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'022f7630-d01e-4b91-abff-28bc893c1197\', \'multiverseId\': 475744}, \'multiverseid\': 475744}]', "[{'name': 'Dornwaldfälle', 'text': 'Die Dornwaldfälle kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Dornwaldfälle ins Spiel kommen, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475941&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a1d6bf9-c3ba-499c-9b5a-c024c91fe720', 'multiverseId': 475941}, 'multiverseid': 475941}, {'name': 'Cascadas bosquespinoso', 'text': 'Las Cascadas bosquespinoso entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\nCuando las Cascadas bosquespinoso entren al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475951&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '003c4549-2b7d-4e5e-8c87-8dfaba6086d5', 'multiverseId': 475951}, 'multiverseid': 475951}, {'name': 'Chutes de Boisépine', 'text': 'Les Chutes de Boisépine arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nQuand les Chutes de Boisépine arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=475961&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'s