\n{T}: добавьте {G} или {U}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476011&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '980fe2b1-c2fe-4242-9d5f-25453de4f734', 'multiverseId': 476011}, 'multiverseid': 476011}, {'name': '棘林瀑布', 'text': '棘林瀑布须横置进战场。\\n当棘林瀑布进战场时，你获得1点生命。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476021&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73471834-a61b-475e-b9e4-1225bf84d71f', 'multiverseId': 476021}, 'multiverseid': 476021}, {'name': '棘林瀑布', 'text': '棘林瀑布須橫置進戰場。\\n當棘林瀑布進戰場時，你獲得1點生命。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476031&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d763b98-438a-40a4-a2b4-b1677a5a3b7b', 'multiverseId': 476031}, 'multiverseid': 476031}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dreister Langfinger // Gemeiner Diebstahl\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nDer Dreiste Langfinger kann nur fliegende Kreaturen blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Dreister Langfinger\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473270&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'968e6ad9-0a09-4b48-9564-5aac0bc48fbe\', \'multiverseId\': 473270}, \'multiverseid\': 473270}, {\'name\': \'Ladronzuelo atrevido // Hurto\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nEl Ladronzuelo atrevido solo puede bloquear a criaturas con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón hada\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Ladronzuelo atrevido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=473539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7266d7de-c5f2-4162-a125-0c805cec893b\', \'multiverseId\':